tion cannot be undone.'=>'您確定要刪除所有 AI 記錄嗎？此動作無法撤銷。','Are you sure you want to delete all BLUE marked files listed here. Please download Wordpress /wp-content/uploads/wpforo/ folder to your local computer before deleting files, this is not undoable.'=>'確定要刪除全部藍色標記的文件嗎? 請下載 WordPress 下的 /wp-content/uploads/wpforo/ 目錄做備份，因為這個操作是不可恢復的。','Are you sure you want to delete all DARK RED marked files listed here. Please download Wordpress /wp-content/uploads/wpforo/ folder to your local computer before deleting files, this is not undoable.'=>'你確信要刪除列出的所有深紅標記的文件嗎？此刪除將不可恢復，刪除之前請將Wordpress 下的  /wp-content/uploads/wpforo/文件夾下載到本機備份。','Are you sure you want to delete all ORANGE marked files listed here. Please download Wordpress /wp-content/uploads/wpforo/ folder to your local computer before deleting files, this is not undoable.'=>'確定要刪除全部橙色標記的文件嗎? 請下載 WordPress 下的 /wp-content/uploads/wpforo/ 目錄做備份，因為這個操作是不可恢復的。','Are you sure you want to delete all RED marked files listed here. Please download Wordpress /wp-content/uploads/wpforo/ folder to your local computer before deleting files, this is not undoable.'=>'確定要刪除全部深紅色標記的文件嗎? 請下載 WordPress 下的 /wp-content/uploads/wpforo/ 目錄做備份，因為這個操作是不可恢復的。','Are you sure you want to delete the selected logs?'=>'您確定要刪除選取的記錄嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete this activity?'=>'您確定要刪除此活動嗎？','Are you sure you want to DELETE this board and his data permanently?'=>'您確定要永久刪除這個討論區和他的資料嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete this file?'=>'您確定要刪除此文件嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete this forum?'=>'您確定要刪除此論壇嗎？','Are you sure you want to DELETE this item?'=>'你確定要刪除這個項目嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete this log?'=>'您確定要刪除此記錄嗎？','Are you sure you want to delete this theme files?'=>'您確定要刪除此主題的文件嗎？','Are you sure you want to DELETE this USER? This will open the WordPress user deletion page where you can choose to delete or reassign their content.'=>'您確定要刪除此使用者嗎？這將會開啟 WordPress 使用者刪除頁面，您可以選擇刪除或重新指定他們的內容。','are you sure you want to delete?'=>'您確定要刪除嗎？','Are you sure you want to permanently delete this file?'=>'確認要永久刪除此文件？','Are you sure you want to remove this access set? Usergroups which attached to this access will lost all forum permissions.'=>'您確定要刪除此訪問權限嗎？附屬於這個訪問權限的所有論壇權限將丟失。','Are you sure you want to reset all settings and style colors to default?'=>'您確定要重置所有設置和色彩樣式嗎？','Are you sure you want to UNBAN this user?'=>'您確定要禁用此使用者嗎？','Are you sure you wanted to do that?'=>'你確定要這麼做嗎？','Are you sure, you want to activate this user?'=>'您確定要啟用此使用者嗎？','Are you sure, you want to BAN this user?'=>'再次確認，您要屏蔽該會員？','Are you sure, you want to deactivate this user?'=>'您確定要停用此使用者嗎？','Are you sure, you want to UNBAN this user?'=>'再次確認，您不再屏蔽該會員？','Are you sure? This will delete ALL indexed data and cannot be undone!'=>'您確定嗎？這將會刪除所有索引資料，而且無法撤銷！','As an addition to email notification functions, wpForo has in-forum notification system. You can see the notification bell on forum menu bar or in the sidebar with \'My Profile and Notifications\' widget.'=>'除了電子郵件通知功能之外，wpForo 也有版面內通知系統。您可以在論壇功能表欄上看到通知鈴聲，或者在側邊欄上的 「我的檔案和通知 」小工具中看到通知鈴聲。','as long as you have an active subscription'=>'只要您已啟用訂閱','ASC'=>'ASC','Ascending order'=>'升序','Ask a question'=>'問一個問題','Ask AI Bot to reply'=>'請 AI Bot 回覆','Ask for more details'=>'詢問更多詳細資訊','at least'=>'至少','Attach file:'=>'添加文件：','Attachment'=>'附件','Attachment removed'=>'附件已刪除','Attachments'=>'附件','Attachments Size'=>'附件容量','Attribute all content to:'=>'將所有內容歸入:','Author'=>'作者','Author Email'=>'作者電郵','Author Name'=>'作者姓名','Author Settings'=>'作者設定','Author Usergroup'=>'作者使用者群組','Authoritative - Expert and confident'=>'權威 - 專家和自信','Auto (Board Language)'=>'自動 (板卡語言)','Auto Drafting Interval'=>'自動繪圖間隔','Auto Moderation'=>'自動調節','Auto Refresh Interval Seconds'=>'自動刷新間隔 秒','Auto Reply to Topics'=>'自動回覆主題','Auto-approve the content'=>'自動批核內容','Auto-approved'=>'自動核准','Auto-Ban After Unapproved Posts Count'=>'未經核准的文章計數後自動封禁','Auto-cleanup disabled. Logs will be kept forever.'=>'停用自動清理功能。日誌將永遠保留。','Auto-delete logs older than'=>'自動刪除超過','Auto-pause when limit reached'=>'達到限制時自動暫停','Auto-Tags'=>'自動標籤','Autofilter by current forum'=>'自動過濾器由當前論壇','Automate your forum with scheduled AI tasks. Create topics, generate replies, and keep your community active 24/7.'=>'使用排程的 AI 任務自動化您的論壇。建立主題、產生回覆，讓您的社群全天候保持活躍。','Automatically ban users when they reach this number of unapproved posts. Set to 0 to disable auto-ban.'=>'當使用者未核准的文章達到此數量時，會自動封鎖該使用者。設定為 0 可停用自動封鎖。','Automatically enforce your forum rules and community guidelines. AI checks every post against configurable policies including topic relevance, promotional content restrictions, and illegal content detection. Smart keyword pre-filtering catches obvious violations instantly without API calls, while nuanced cases receive full AI analysis. Define custom rules for your community and let AI ensure members stay on topic and follow your guidelines.'=>'自動執行您的論壇規則和社群準則。AI 會根據可設定的政策檢查每篇文章，包括主題相關性、宣傳內容限制和非法內容偵測。智慧型關鍵字預先過濾功能可立即偵測明顯的違規行為，無需呼叫 API，而細微的情況則會收到完整的 AI 分析。為您的社群定義自訂規則，讓 AI 確保會員貼近主題並遵從您的準則。','Automatically index all new approved topics'=>'自動索引所有已核准的新主題','Automatically index new and approved topics'=>'自動索引新的和已核准的主題','Automatically index new and updated WordPress content'=>'自動索引新的和更新的 WordPress 內容','Automatically index new content'=>'自動索引新內容','Automatically manage topic tags'=>'自動管理主題標籤','Available'=>'可使用','Available After Activation'=>'啟動後可用','Available again tomorrow'=>'明天再次上市','Available AI Features'=>'可用的 AI 功能','Available Plans'=>'可用計劃','Avatar'=>'頭像','Avatar image is too big maximum allowed size is %s'=>'頭像圖片太大最大允許尺寸為％s','Avatar image is too big maximum allowed size is 2MB'=>'頭像圖片太大，最大允許大小為2MB','Avatars Size'=>'頭像尺寸','Average per Day'=>'平均每天','Avg Replies/Topic'=>'平均回覆/主題','Avg Replies/User'=>'平均回覆/使用者','Avg Reply Length'=>'平均回覆長度','Avg Response'=>'平均回應','Avg Response Time'=>'平均回應時間','Avg Topic Length'=>'平均主題長度','Awaiting Activation'=>'等待啟動','Awaiting moderation'=>'待審核','B'=>'B','Back'=>'返回','Background processing in progress: %s topics are queued for indexing.'=>'背景處理中：%s 主題已排隊等待建立索引。','Badge Icon'=>'徽章圖標','Balanced'=>'平衡','Balanced (1 action = 2 credits)'=>'平衡 (1 動作 = 2 學分)','Balanced (2 credits per message)'=>'平衡 (每則訊息 2 個信用點)','Balanced (2 credits)'=>'平衡（2 個學分）','Balanced - 2 credits per reply'=>'平衡 - 每次回覆 2 學分','Balanced - 2 credits per run'=>'平衡 - 每次運行 2 個學分','Balanced - 2 credits per topic'=>'均衡 - 每個主題 2 學分','Ban'=>'禁令','Ban User'=>'屏蔽會員','Ban user when spam is suspected'=>'在懷疑垃圾郵件時禁止用戶','Ban&nbsp;User'=>'禁止&nbsp;使用者','Banned'=>'已被禁','Base Settings'=>'基本設定','Based on last 200 posts'=>'根據最近的 200 篇文章','Basic Information'=>'基本資訊','Batch Embedding'=>'批次嵌入','Beginner\'s Guide - Introductory content'=>'新手指南 - 入門內容','Best Practice Advice - Recommended way'=>'最佳實務建議 - 建議方式','Best Practices - Recommended approaches'=>'最佳實務 - 建議方法','Block Widgets replacing the legacy widgets.'=>'Block Widgets 取代傳統的 widgets。','Blog Comments'=>'博客的評論','Blog Posts'=>'博客文章','Board'=>'董事會','Board Description'=>'板卡說明','Board Label (used in menu, max 12 characters)'=>'Board Label (用於選單，最多 12 個字元)','Board Settings'=>'板卡設定','Board Slug'=>'板蛞蝓','Board Statistic'=>'統計','Board Title'=>'董事會名稱','Board:'=>'董事會：','boardid'=>'boardid','Boards'=>'董事會','Boards are not Forum Categories'=>'討論版不是論壇類別','Body'=>'身體','Bonus Credits:'=>'額外獎勵：','Bookmark'=>'加入書籤','Bookmarks'=>'書籤','Boost engagement with intelligent reply generation. AI monitors your forum for unanswered topics, analyzes context from existing discussions and knowledge base, and automatically posts helpful, relevant responses through bot users. Configure reply frequency, tone, and trigger conditions to maintain authentic community interaction.'=>'以智慧型回覆產生提升參與度。AI 會監控您的論壇是否有未回答的主題，分析現有討論和知識庫的內容，並透過殭屍使用者自動張貼有用的相關回覆。設定回覆頻率、語調和觸發條件，以維持真實的社群互動。','Bot Reply'=>'Bot 回覆','Bot Reply Response Language'=>'機器人回覆回應語言','Bot Reply User'=>'機器人回覆使用者','Bot Settings'=>'機器人設定','Bottom'=>'按鍵','Break language barriers and grow your global community. No more limiting your community to one language. Multi-language AI translation lets members from anywhere participate naturally. Each user sees content in their language, posts in their language, and AI bridges the gap—no manual translation needed.'=>'打破語言障礙，發展您的全球社群。您的社群不再局限於一種語言。多語言 AI 翻譯讓來自任何地方的成員都能自然地參與。每位使用者都能以自己的語言觀看內容、以自己的語言發表文章，而 AI 則能消除語言間的鴻溝 - 無須手動翻譯。','Brief (100-200 words)'=>'簡介 (100-200 字)','Brief guidelines for AI responses (max 120 characters)'=>'AI 回應的簡短指引（最多 120 個字元）','Brief theme to guide topic creation (max 120 characters)'=>'用於指導創建主題的簡短主題（最多 120 個字元）','BuddyPress'=>'BuddyPress','BuddyPress Activity Integration'=>'BuddyPress活動集成','BuddyPress Integration'=>'BuddyPress 整合','BuddyPress Notification Integration'=>'BuddyPress通知集成','BuddyPress Profile for the whole website including forum.'=>'整個網站（包括論壇）的 BuddyPress 設定檔。','BuddyPress Profile Forum Tab Integration'=>'BuddyPress配置文件論壇標籤集成','Bulgarian'=>'保加利亞語','Bulk Actions'=>'批量操作','Business'=>'業務','Business Features'=>'業務特色','Business Plan Required'=>'需要業務計劃','Button border color and button hover background color'=>'按鈕邊框顏色和按鈕懸停背景顏色','Buttons background color'=>'按鈕背景顏色','Buy Additional Credits'=>'購買額外遊戲幣','Buy Now'=>'立即購買','by'=>'發布者','by %s'=>'發布者%s','By default '=>'依預設','By default all members get rating badges and titles based on number of posts. However, using this option you can grant lower or higher rating to certain user (this user). The default member reputation badges, titles and points can be managed in Forums > Settings > Members Tab.'=>'預設情況下，所有會員都會根據發表文章的數量獲得等級徽章和稱號。但是，您可以使用此選項賦予特定會員 (此會員) 較低或較高的評分。預設的會員評等徽章、頭銜和點數可在論壇 > 設定 > 會員標籤中管理。','By default wpForo uses WordPress avatars. In most cases it\'s the Gravatar. If this option is enabled, users will be able to set their avatars with external URLs or upload from their devices.'=>'預設 wpForo 使用 WordPress 頭像。在大多數情況下是 Gravatar。如果啟用此選項，使用者將能夠使用外部 URL 設定頭像或從裝置上傳頭像。','By default, wpForo allows all secure HTML tags in post content. Allowing a new HTML tag may affect your forum security. For example the &lt;iframe&gt; and &lt;script&gt; HTML tags may be used by spammers and hackers to load 3rd party ads and viruses to forum. <br>Example of adding a new HTML tags: <code>b, em, p, code, style, a(href title), img(src alt title), embed(src width height) ...</code>'=>'預設情況下，wpForo 允許在文章內容中使用所有安全的 HTML 標籤。允許新的 HTML 標籤可能會影響您論壇的安全性。例如，&lt;iframe&gt;和&lt;script&gt;HTML 標籤可能會被垃圾郵件發送者和黑客用來載入第三方廣告和病毒到論壇。<br>新增 HTML 標籤的範例：<code>b, em, p, code, style, a(href title), img(src alt title), embed(src width height) ...</code>。','By disabling this option you can exclude forum administrators from the topic viewers section.'=>'通過禁用此選項，您可以從主題查看器列表中排除論壇管理員。','Cached'=>'緩存','Cached %s ago'=>'緩存 %s 前','Can add tags'=>'可以添加標籤','Can answer own question'=>'可以回答自己的問題','Can approve/unapprove content'=>'可以批准/取消批准內容','Can attach file'=>'可以附加文件','Can be also used as Secondary Usergroup'=>'也可以用作輔助用戶組','Can be refreshed one time per day'=>'每天可刷新一次','Can close topic'=>'可以關閉主題','Can create poll'=>'可以創建投票','Can create topic'=>'可以創建話題','Can delete own reply'=>'可以刪除自己的回覆','Can delete own topic'=>'可以刪除自己的話題','Can delete replies'=>'可以刪除回復','Can delete topic'=>'可以刪除話題','Can edit own replay'=>'可以編輯自己的答覆','Can edit own reply'=>'可以編輯自己的回覆','Can edit own topic'=>'可以編輯自己的話題','Can edit replies'=>'可以編輯回復','Can edit topic'=>'可以編輯話題','Can enter forum'=>'可以進入論壇','Can enter topic'=>'可輸入主題','Can leave voice posts'=>'可以留言','Can like'=>'可讚','Can listen voice posts'=>'可以收聽語音文章','Can move topic'=>'可以移動話題','Can post reply'=>'可以發表回復','Can reply to own topic'=>'可以回覆自己的主題','Can report'=>'可以報告','Can set own topic answered'=>'可設置自有話題已被解答','Can set own topic private'=>'可設置自有話題為私密','Can set own topic solved'=>'可設置自己的話題是否解決','Can set topic answered'=>'可設置話題已被回復','Can set topic private'=>'可設置話題為私密','Can set topic solved'=>'可設置話題是否解決','Can set topic sticky'=>'可設置話題置頂','Can subscribe'=>'可以訂閱','Can view attached files'=>'可以查看附件','Can view forum'=>'可以查看論壇','Can view poll result'=>'可以查看投票結果','Can view private topic'=>'可查看私密話題','Can view replies'=>'可以查看回復','Can view topic'=>'可以查看話題','Can vote'=>'可以投票','Can vote poll'=>'可以投票','Can\'t add forum'=>'不能添加論壇','Can\'t add new language'=>'不能添加新的語言','Can\'t delete this Usergroup'=>'不能刪除該用戶組','Can\'t send confirmation email'=>'不能發送確認電郵','Can\'t send report email'=>'不能發送報告電郵','Can\'t subscribe to this item'=>'不能訂閱該條目','Can\'t upload file'=>'無法上傳檔案','Can\'t write a post: This topic is closed'=>'不能寫評論：該貼已關閉','Can`t upload file'=>'不能上傳文件','Cancel'=>'取消','Cancel Registration'=>'取消註冊','Cannot combine Topic Tags with User IDs filter. Please use only one.'=>'無法結合 Topic Tags 與 User IDs 過濾器。請只使用一個。','Cannot update forum hierarchy'=>'無法更新論壇的層次結構','Cannot update post data'=>'無法更新帖子數據','Case Study - Real-world example'=>'個案研究 - 實際案例','Casual - Relaxed and informal'=>'Casual - 輕鬆、非正式','Categories and Forums'=>'分類和版塊','Category Cover Image'=>'類別封面圖片','Category Layout'=>'分類布局','Category layout and cover image'=>'分類版面與封面圖片','Category panel background color'=>'類別面板背景顏色','Challenge/Exercise - Interactive content'=>'挑戰/練習 - 互動內容','Change'=>'變更','Change Color Style'=>'變更顏色樣式','Change Cover Image'=>'變更封面圖片','Change in AI Content Indexing'=>'AI 內容索引的變更','Change password'=>'更改密碼','Change usergroup to…'=>'變更使用者群組為...','Chat'=>'聊天','Chatbot AI Quality'=>'聊天機 AI 品質','Chatbot Response Language'=>'聊天機器人回應語言','Check Account Status'=>'檢查帳戶狀態','Check Activation Status'=>'檢查啟動狀態','Check Period'=>'檢查期間','Check Status'=>'檢查狀態','Check the checkbox share options to activate.'=>'勾選核取方塊共用選項以啟用。','Check the status box for progress.'=>'檢查進度狀態方塊。','Check the Terms of Service checkbox'=>'勾選服務條款核取方塊','Checkbox: I Accept Forum Rules'=>'複選框：我接受論壇規則','Checkbox: I Accept Website Terms and Privacy Policy'=>'複選框：我接受網站條款和隱私政策','Checkbox: I Agree to Forum Privacy Policy'=>'複選框：我同意論壇隱私政策','Checkbox: I Agree to Receive an Email Confirmation'=>'複選框：我同意接收電子郵件確認','Chinese'=>'中文','Choose how AI generates replies:'=>'選擇 AI 如何產生回覆：','Choose Target Forum'=>'選擇目標論壇','Choose the style of AI-generated replies. This affects how the AI approaches answering questions.'=>'選擇 AI 產生回覆的風格。這會影響 AI 回答問題的方式。','Choose the style of AI-generated topic summaries. Different styles suit different types of discussions.'=>'選擇 AI 產生的主題摘要風格。不同的風格適合不同類型的討論。','Choose the target length for AI-generated replies.'=>'選擇 AI 產生回覆的目標長度。','Choose the tone for AI-generated replies. This affects the personality and voice of the response.'=>'為 AI 產生的回覆選擇語氣。這會影響回覆的個性和語氣。','Choose to Upload JSON file.'=>'選擇上傳 JSON 檔案。','Choose what this task will do'=>'選擇此任務要做的事','Choose where the AI should look for information when generating replies.'=>'選擇 AI 在產生回覆時應該從哪裡尋找資訊。','Choose which method to use when user delete action comes. [Soft] option will not remove any content this user has already created. It\'ll only remove the user with all account information. The  posts\' author name will be changed to "Anonymous ID". [Hard] option will remove the user data and any content this user has already created.'=>'選擇使用者刪除動作時使用的方法。[Soft] 選項不會移除此使用者已建立的任何內容。它只會刪除使用者的所有帳號資訊。文章的作者名會改成「匿名 ID」。[硬] 選項會移除使用者資料以及該使用者已建立的任何內容。','Chunk Size (tokens)'=>'分塊大小 (代幣)','Chunk size must be between 100 and 1024 tokens.'=>'分塊大小必須介於 100 到 1024 個代幣之間。','Chunking Configuration'=>'分塊配置','Clarifying Questions - Ask for details'=>'澄清問題 - 詢問細節','Classic Search'=>'經典搜尋','Clean'=>'清潔','Clean Passed'=>'乾淨通過','Clean Up'=>'清潔','Cleaned Up!'=>'清理乾淨！','Cleanup Indexing Session'=>'清理索引階段','Cleanup options reset successfully'=>'清理選項重置成功','Clear'=>'清除','Clear all'=>'清除所有','Clear failed: %s'=>'清除失敗：%s','Clear Forum Index'=>'清除論壇索引','Clear Selected Forum Index'=>'清除選取的論壇索引','Clear WordPress Index'=>'清除 WordPress 索引','Cleared %1$d embedding(s) from %2$d forum (%3$s storage mode). Topics can now be re-indexed.'=>'從 %2$d 版面 (%3$s 儲存模式) 清除了 %1$d 嵌入。主題現在可以重新索引。' . "\0" . '','Clears pending indexing queues, WP-Cron jobs, session locks and status caches. Use this if indexing is stuck on "Indexing..." but nothing is progressing. Works for both local and cloud storage modes. Does not delete any indexed data.'=>'清除待處理的索引佇列、WP-Cron 工作、會話鎖及狀態快取。如果索引卡在「索引中...」，但沒有任何進展，請使用此功能。本機與雲端儲存模式皆適用。不會刪除任何索引資料。','Clears pending WordPress post/page indexing queue, WP-Cron jobs and status cache. Use this if WordPress indexing is stuck on "Indexing..." but nothing is progressing. Works for both local and cloud storage modes. Does not delete any indexed data.'=>'清除待處理的 WordPress 帖子/頁面索引佇列、WP-Cron 工作及狀態快取。如果 WordPress 索引停留在 "Indexing..."，但沒有任何進展，請使用此功能。本機與雲端儲存模式皆適用。不會刪除任何索引資料。','Click <strong>"Generate API Key & Connect"</strong>'=>'按一下 <strong>「產生 API 金鑰並連線」</strong>。','Click to delete Blue marked files'=>'點擊刪除藍色標記文件','Click to delete Dark Red marked files'=>'點擊刪除深紅標記文件','Click to delete Orange marked files'=>'點擊刪除橙色標記文件','Click to delete Red marked files'=>'點擊刪除紅色標記文件','Click to open forum privacy policy below'=>'點擊下面打開論壇隱私政策','Click to open forum rules below'=>'點擊下面打開論壇規則','Close'=>'關閉','close'=>'關閉','Closed'=>'已經關閉','closed the topic'=>'關閉主題','closed the topic %s'=>'關閉主題 %s','Closed Topics'=>'封閉主題','cloud'=>'雲','Cloud (AWS S3 Vectors)'=>'雲端 (AWS S3 向量)','Cloud (gVectors on AWS)'=>'雲端 (gVectors on AWS)','Cloud storage (gVectors AI Services on AWS Cloud) provides faster search performance for large forums but requires sharing data with our API.'=>'雲端儲存 (AWS Cloud 上的 gVectors AI 服務) 可為大型論壇提供更快的搜尋效能，但需要與我們的 API 分享資料。','Code examples'=>'程式碼範例','Collaborative - Work together approach'=>'協作 - 共同合作的方式','Collapse All'=>'全部折疊','Collapsed'=>'關閉','Color'=>'顏色','Colors &amp; Styles'=>'顏色與樣式','Colors Documentation'=>'顏色文檔','Coming Soon'=>'即將推出','Coming soon'=>'即將推出','Comma or newline separated. This filter works independently - ignores other filters above.'=>'以逗號或換行分隔。此過濾器獨立運作 - 忽略上述其他過濾器。','Comma separated email addresses of forum administrators to get forum notifications. For example post report messages.'=>'論壇管理員用逗號分隔開的電郵地址，用以獲得論壇通知。例如帖子的舉報等。','Comma-separated post IDs. Indexes regardless of content type or date.'=>'以逗號分隔的文章 ID。不論內容類型或日期，都會建立索引。','Comma-separated tags t