 on the top right section to set the layout you want. This option is only available for Categories (top parent forums). Other forums and sub-forums inherit it. They cannot have a different layout, therefore the layout dropdown option becomes disabled if this forum is not a Category.'=>'論壇可以顯示不同的布局（擴展，簡化，問答，螺紋）。使用右上角部分的“類別布局”下拉列表設置所需的布局。此選項僅適用於類別（頂級父論壇）。其他論壇和子論壇繼承它。它們不能具有不同的布局，因此如果此論壇不是類別，則布局下拉選項將被禁用。','Forums font size:'=>'論壇字型大小：','Forums only = random topic from selected forums'=>'僅論壇 = 從選定論壇中隨機選取主題','Forums only = topics from selected forums'=>'僅論壇 = 選定論壇的主題','Forums RSS Feed'=>'論壇RSS Feed','Free / Starter'=>'免費 / 入門','Freemius'=>'Freemius','French'=>'法語','Frequency'=>'頻率','Fresh Installation'=>'全新安裝','Fri'=>'星期五','Friendly - Warm and approachable'=>'友善 - 溫暖且平易近人','From'=>'來自','FROM Email Address'=>'來自電郵','From Email Address'=>'來自電郵地址','FROM Name'=>'來自名稱','From Name'=>'來自','From:'=>'來自','Front - Can access to add topic page'=>'正面 - 可存取新增主題頁面','Front - Can access to attachments'=>'前方 - 可存取附件','Front - Can have signature'=>'前面 - 可以簽名','Front - Can pass moderation'=>'前端- 可以通過審核','Front - Can see AI topic suggestion'=>'前方 - 可看到 AI 主題建議','Front - Can upload avatar'=>'Front - 可以上傳頭像','Front - Can upload cover'=>'正面 - 可上傳封面','Front - Can use AI post translation'=>'前台 - 可使用 AI 後台翻譯','Front - Can use AI semantic search'=>'前端 - 可使用 AI 語意搜尋','Front - Can use AI topic summarization'=>'前端 - 可使用 AI 專題摘要','Front - Can view avatars'=>'Front - 可以查看頭像','Front - Can view member about me'=>'Front - 可以查看用戶“關於我”','Front - Can view member activity'=>'前端-可以查看會員活動','Front - Can view member email'=>'Front - 可以查看用戶的電郵地址','Front - Can view member location'=>'Front - 可以查看用戶所在地','Front - Can view member occupation'=>'前端- 可以查看會員職業','Front - Can view member reg. date'=>'Front - 可以查看用戶註冊日期','Front - Can view member reputation'=>'Front - 可以查看用戶聲望','Front - Can view member signature'=>'前端  - 可以查看成員簽名','Front - Can view member social networks'=>'Front - 可以查看用戶社交網絡','Front - Can view member subscrip