語言','German'=>'德國','Get Addon'=>'取得附加元件','Get AI-generated actionable moderation suggestions based on your forum\'s data. Available once per day.'=>'根據您論壇的資料，取得 AI 產生的可執行修改建議。每天可用一次。','Get AI-powered insights and recommendations'=>'獲得人工智能驅動的洞察力和建議','Get instant AI-generated summaries of long forum discussions. Help members quickly understand the key points, main conclusions, and important details of any topic without reading through hundreds of replies. Perfect for catching up on active discussions or reviewing complex threads at a glance.'=>'即時取得由 AI 產生的長論壇討論摘要。幫助會員快速瞭解任何主題的重點、主要結論和重要細節，而無需閱讀成百上千的回覆。非常適合用來追蹤活躍的討論，或一目了然地檢閱複雜的主題。','Get Started'=>'開始使用','Get started in one click for FREE!'=>'點擊一下即可免費開始使用！','Get started with one click &mdash; no configuration needed.'=>'一按即可開始使用；無需任何設定。','Go to <strong>wpForo &rarr; AI Features</strong>'=>'前往 <strong>wpForo &rarr; AI 功能</strong>。','Go to <strong>wpForo &rarr; Forums</strong> to change the layout of any forum.'=>'前往 <strong>wpForo &rarr; 論壇</strong> 以變更任何論壇的版面配置。','Go to <strong>wpForo &rarr; Settings &rarr; AI Features</strong> to toggle each feature on or off.'=>'前往 <strong>wpForo &rarr; Settings &rarr; AI Features</strong> 以開啟或關閉每項功能。','Go to Advanced Settings Tab, find the "URLs to exclude from caching" option'=>'移至「進階設定」標籤，找到「從快取中排除的 URL」選項','Go to Advanced Tab, scroll down to "Rejected URL Strings" option'=>'移至「進階」標籤，向下捲動至「拒絕 URL 字串」選項','Go to Advanced Tab, scroll down to Rejected URL Strings option'=>'移至「進階」標籤，向下捲動至拒絕 URL 字串選項','Go to Exclude Tab, find the "Do Not Cache URIs" option'=>'移至「排除」標籤，找到「不快取 URI」選項','Go to first unread post'=>'前往第一篇未讀文章','Go to Overview'=>'前往概觀','Go to the addon page'=>'前往附加元件頁面','Good match'=>'良好的搭配','Google reCAPTCHA'=>'Google reCAPTCHA','Google reCAPTCHA data are not submitted'=>'Google reCAPTCHA數據未提交','Google reCAPTCHA verification failed'=>'Google reCAPTCHA驗證失敗','Google+'=>'Google+','Granted Extra Free Credits %s'=>'授予額外免費積分 %s','Greek'=>'灰色','green'=>'綠色','grey'=>'灰色','Group'=>'組'