 謝謝！','Hello! I\'m your forum assistant. I can help you find information, answer questions about discussions, and navigate the forum. What would you like to know?'=>'您好我是您的論壇助理。我可以幫助您尋找資訊、回答有關討論的問題，以及瀏覽討論區。您想知道什麼？','Help us improve by telling us why you\'re disconnecting'=>'請告訴我們您斷線的原因，以幫助我們改進','Help us improve by telling us why you\'re removing your data'=>'請告訴我們您移除資料的原因，以協助我們改進。','Help wpForo to grow, show plugin info'=>'幫助wpforo成長，顯示插件信息','Helpful - Supportive and guiding'=>'幫助 - 支援和指導','Helpful Answer - Direct solution'=>'有用的解答 - 直接解決方案','here'=>'這裡','Here you can change your forum style. There are six predefined styles (default, red, green, orange, gray and dark), these are set of different colors. You can change them and create your own set of colors. If you need more customization, you can add custom CSS code in the corresponding textarea. Also, you can change font size of forums, topics and post content.'=>'您可以在此更改版面樣式。有六種預先定義的樣式（預設、紅色、綠色、橙色、灰色和深色），這些樣式有不同的顏色。您可以更改它們並創建您自己的顏色集。如果您需要更多的自訂功能，您可以在對應的文字區域中加入自訂 CSS 程式碼。此外，您也可以變更論壇、主題和文章內容的字型大小。','Here you can find many ways to protect your forum from spammers. Most of them are already configured and enabled with default values. You can make spam protection more powerfully if you configure Google reCAPTCHA in Settings > Google reCAPTCHA section and install others spam protection plugins like Akismet.'=>'在這裡您可以找到許多方法來保護您的論壇不被垃圾郵件攻擊。其中大多數都已設定並啟用預設值。如果您在設定 > Google reCAPTCHA 區段設定 Google reCAPTCHA，並安裝其他垃圾郵件防護外掛，例如 Akismet，就可以讓垃圾郵件防護功能更強大。','Here you can find social network sharing options. wpForo allows sharing almost all forum content (forums, topics, posts individually). The share button style and location is very flexible. There are a lot of options to set button style, type, location, etc...'=>'wpForo 允許分享幾乎所有的版面內容 (版面、主題、個別文章)。分享按鈕的樣式和位置非常靈活。有許多選項可以設定按鈕的樣式、類型、位置等...','Here you can manage admin bar displaying options, using WordPress date format in forum and permalinks of general pages. If you have hmore then one forum board, this settings are still are general for all forum boards.'=>'在這裡您可以管理管理列的顯示選項、在討論區中使用 WordPress 日期格式以及一般頁面的永久連結。如果您有一個以上的討論版，此設定仍適用於所有討論版。','Here you can manage forum specific components which are displayed on the frontend. All options are grouped by forum layouts. You can find all necessary options to manage forum layout specific features. Each forum layout has its own specific features.'=>'在這裡您可以管理顯示在前端的版面特定元件。所有選項都依版面佈局分類。您可以找到管理版面特定功能的所有必要選項。每個版面都有其特定的功能。','Here, you can configure header information (FROM name and email) of forum specific emails. You can set administrators and moderators email addresses to get email notification when a new topic or reply is posted. Here you can also find user registration, password resetting and post reporting email templates.'=>'在這裡，您可以設定討論區特定電子郵件的標頭資訊 (FROM 名稱和電子郵件)。您可以設定管理員和版主的電子郵件地址，當有新主題或回覆張貼時，他們就會收到電子郵件通知。您也可以在這裡找到使用者註冊、密碼重設和回報文章的電子郵件範本。','Here, you can find all settings related to topic and post creation including rich editor settings, text limitations, attachments control, option to enable WordPress plugin shortcodes in wpForo posts, post drafting and preview options. Some settings are grouped by forum layouts and some of them are general for all forum layouts.'=>'在這裡，您可以找到所有與主題和文章建立相關的設定，包括豐富編輯器設定、文字限制、附件控制、在 wpForo 文章中啟用 WordPress 外掛程式簡碼的選項、文章起草和預覽選項。有些設定是依版面佈局分類，有些則是適用於所有版面佈局。','Hi [mentioned-user-name]! <br>

