 [post_link]'=>'您好 [user_display_name]！<br

 你在 [owner_display_name] 發表的 "[topic_title]"中被提及。

 [post_link]。','Hi [user_login] , Thank you for your registration. Your account has been approved. You can login here: [login_link]'=>'您好 [user_login] , 感謝您註冊。您的帳號已被核准。您可以在這裡登入：[登入連結]','Hide avatar'=>'隱藏頭像','Hide buttons'=>'隱藏按鈕','Hide Inactive Members'=>'隱藏不活躍會員','Hide notification bell'=>'隱藏通知鈴聲','Hide Replies'=>'隱藏回復','Hide this widget for guests'=>'為訪客隱藏此 Widget','Hide user data'=>'隱藏使用者資料','Hide user name'=>'隱藏使用者名稱','High (comprehensive)'=>'高（全面）','Higher overlap = better search quality at chunk boundaries.'=>'較高的重疊度 = 在區塊邊界有較好的搜尋品質。','Highlight AI Assistant Toggle'=>'突顯 AI 助理切換','Hindi'=>'北印度語','Hot'=>'熱門','How long to temporarily ban users who exceed flood limits. Only applies when action is set to \'Temporarily ban\'.'=>'暫時封鎖超過泛濫限制的使用者多久。僅適用於動作設定為「暫時封禁」時。','How targeting works:'=>'目標定位如何運作：','How this affects indexing:'=>'這如何影響索引：','How to Fix WordPress Not Sending Email Issue'=>'如何修復WordPress不發送電子郵件問題','How-To Guide - Practical instructions'=>'操作指南 - 實用說明','https://gvectors.com/'=>'https://gvectors.com/','https://wpforo.com'=>'https://wpforo.com','Humorous - Light-hearted and witty'=>'幽默 - 輕鬆、機智','Hungarian'=>'匈牙利語','I agree'=>'我同意','I agree to receive an email confirmation with a link to set a password.'=>'我同意收到一封電子郵件確認，其中包含設置密碼的鏈接。','I agree to receive email'=>'我同意接收電子郵件','I agree to these rules'=>'我同意這些規則','I allow to create an account and send confirmation email.'=>'我允許創建一個帳戶並發送確認電子郵件。','I allow to create an account based on my Facebook public profile information and send confirmation email.'=>'我允許根據我的Facebook公開個人資料信息創建一個帳戶並發送確認電子郵件。','I couldn\'t find information about that topic in the forum. Please try searching directly or create a new topic to start a discussion.'=>'我在論壇中找不到該主題的相關資訊。請嘗試直接搜尋或建立新主題開始討論。','I couldn\'t find specific forum content related to your question. Would you like to start a new topic to discuss this?'=>'我找不到與您問題相關的特定論壇內容。您是否願意開啟一個新主題來討論這個問題？','I couldn\'t understand how to make it work'=>'我無法理解如何使它工作','I didn\'t like plugin design'=>'我不喜歡插件設計','I do not agree to these rules. Take me away from here.'=>'我不同意這些規則。帶我離開這裡。','I do not agree. Take me away from here.'=>'我不同意。帶我離開這裡。','I found a better plugin'=>'我發現了一個更好的插件','I got it, please dismiss this message'=>'我收到了，請解除此訊息','I have read and agree to %s privacy policy.'=>'我已閱讀並同意 %s 隱私政策。','I have read and agree to %s privacy policy. For more information, please check our privacy policy, where you\'ll get more info on where, how and why we store your data.'=>'我已閱讀並同意%s 隱私政策。 有關詳細信息，請查看我們的隱私政策，您將獲得有關我們存儲數據的位置，方式和原因的更多信息。','I have read and agree to abide by the %s.'=>'我已閱讀並同意遵守 %s.','I have read and agree to the'=>'我已經閱讀並同意','I have read and agree to the %1$s and %2$s. I understand that my forum content will be processed by %3$s service as described in these documents.'=>'我已閱讀並同意 %1$s 和 %2$s。我了解我的論壇內容將由 %3$s 服務處理，如這些文件所述。','I have read and agree to the %s.'=>'我已閱讀並同意 %s.','I understand and want to disconnect the service'=>'我瞭解並想要中斷服務','I understand that all my data will be permanently deleted and want to proceed'=>'我瞭解我的所有資料將被永久刪除，並希望繼續進行','I\'ll reactivate it later'=>'我稍後會重新激活它','ICQ'=>'ICQ','ID'=>'ID','Identify and remove duplicate or near-duplicate tags'=>'找出並移除重複或接近重複的標籤','Idle'=>'閒置','If a category (blue panels) does not have forums (grey panels) it will not be displayed on front-end. Each category should contain at least one forum.'=>'如果一個分類（藍色面板）沒有論壇（灰色面板），它將不會顯示在前端。 每個分類應至少應包含一個論壇。','If No Relevant Content in Forum Found'=>'如果在論壇中找不到相關內容','If the %s button doesn\'t solve the issues. Please use the SQl commands below in your hosting service cPanel > phpMyAdmin Database Manager > WordPress Database > SQL Tab. In case you\'re not familiar with hosting service tools, please contact to your hosting service support team and forward them this message with the SQL command.'=>'如果%s 按鈕無法解決問題。請在您的託管服務cPanel> phpMyAdmin數據庫管理器> WordPress數據庫> SQL選項卡中使用下面的SQl命令。如果您不熟悉託管服務工具，請與您的託管服務支持團隊聯繫，並使用SQL命令將其轉發給他們。','If this option is enabled, all topic links on forums page and on topics page will refer to the first unread post. This behavior is only enabled for logged-in users.'=>'如果啟用此選項，論壇頁面和主題頁面的所有主題連結都會指向第一篇未讀文章。此行為僅對登入的使用者啟用。','If this option is enabled, the [Follow] button will be displayed on user\'s profile pages, allowing users to subscribe to certain users topics and posts. The follower user will receive email notification when the followed user posts a new topic or post.'=>'如果啟用此選項，[追蹤] 按鈕將會顯示在使用者的個人資料頁面上，允許使用者訂閱某些使用者的主題和文章。當被追蹤的使用者發表新的主題或文章時，追蹤的使用者會收到電子郵件通知。','If this option is enabled, users must accept forum rules by checking the required checkbox on registration form to be able create a forum account. The label text of this checkbox can be managed in Forums > Phrases admin page. Search the label phrase, click on edit button and change it.'=>'如果啟用此選項，則用戶必須通過選中註冊表單上的必需複選框接受論壇規則才能創建論壇帳戶。此複選框的標籤文本可以在論壇>短語管理頁面中進行管理。搜索標籤短語，單擊編輯按鈕並進行更改。','If this option is enabled, users must accept forum Terms and Privacy Policy by checking the required checkbox on registration form to be able create a forum account. The checkbox label can be managed in Forums > Phrases admin page'=>'如果啟用此選項，使用者必須在註冊表單上勾選所需的核取方塊，接受論壇條款和隱私權政策，才能建立論壇帳號。核取方塊標籤可以在論壇 > 詞彙管理頁面進行管理。','If this option is enabled, users must accept forum Terms and Privacy Policy by checking the required checkbox on registration form to be able create a forum account. The checkbox label can be managed in Forums > Phrases admin page.'=>'如果啟用此選項，則用戶必須通過選中註冊表單上的必填複選項來接受論壇條款和隱私政策，才能創建論壇帳戶。可以在論壇>短語管理頁面中管理複選框標籤。','If this option is enabled, users must agree to receive an email confirmation with a link to set a password by checking the required checkbox on registration form to be able create a forum account. The checkbox label can be managed in Forums > Phrases admin page.'=>'如果啟用此選項，則用戶必須同意接收電子郵件確認，其中包含設置密碼的鏈接，方法是選中註冊表單上的所需複選框以創建論壇帳戶。可以在論壇>短語管理頁面中管理複選框標籤。','If this option is enabled, users will receive email notification when someone uses @nickname of the user in posts.'=>'如果啟用此選項，當有人在文章中使用使用者的 @nickname 時，使用者會收到電子郵件通知。','If this option is enabled, wpForo will try to use its avatar in all available places.'=>'如果啟用此選項，wpForo 會嘗試在所有可用的地方使用其頭像。','If you got some issue with wpForo, please enable this option before asking for support, this outputs hidden important information to help us debug your issue.'=>'如果你對wpforo的使用有問題，請在請求支援之前啟用此選項，這將隱藏重要信息來幫助我們調試你的問題。','If you have already excluded the forum page from your cache plugin please ignore and close this message using the top %s (x) button.'=>'如果您已經將論壇頁面從快取外掛程式中排除，請忽略並使用上方的 %s (x) 按鈕關閉此訊息。','If you have enabled this option, after registering, the admin will not receive an email notification for newly registered user.'=>'如果啟用此選項，註冊後，管理員將不會收到新註冊用戶的電子郵件通知。','If you have enabled this option, after registering, user can not login without confirming the email.'=>'啟用該項後，用戶註冊時，只有確認了郵件才可登錄。','If you have enabled this option, after registering, user can not login without manually approving of administrator.'=>'如果啟用此選項，使用者註冊後，如果沒有管理員的手動核准，就無法登入。','If you have more than one forum pages (boards) you should create separate rules for each forum board.'=>'如果您有多個版面 (版面)，您應該為每個版面建立獨立的規則。','If you have multiple languages in your website and want to have forums with different languages, then make sure the language of this forum board is set correctly, otherwise just leave the default language.'=>'如果您的網站上有多種語言，並希望擁有不同語言的討論區，那麼請確定此討論區版面的語言設定正確，否則只需保留預設語言即可。','If you have something important to say on forum front page, you can use this editor. The text will be displayed under forum breadcrumb menu, above forum and topic titles.'=>'如果您在論壇首頁上有重要的話要說，可以使用此編輯器。該文本將顯示在論壇麵包屑菜單下方，論壇和主題標題上方。','If you need to customize the registration form and add custom fields, you should check out user custom field builder addon:'=>'如果您需要自訂註冊表單並新增自訂欄位，您應該查看使用者自訂欄位建立器附加元件：','If you want to delete this forum and keep its sub-forums, topics and replies, please select a new target forum in dropdown below'=>'如果你想刪除這個論壇並保持其子論壇，主題和回復，請選擇下拉菜單下面新的目標論壇','If you want us to contact you please click on "I agree to receive email" checkbox, then fill out your email. We\'ll try to do our best to help you with problems.'=>'如果您希望我們與您聯繫，請單擊“我同意接收電子郵件”複選框，然後填寫您的電子郵件。我們會盡力幫助您解決問題。','If your Freemius plan was not activated automatically after purchase, enter your License ID here.'=>'如果您的 Freemius 計劃在購買後沒有自動啟動，請在此輸入您的授權 ID。','If your Paddle payment was not registered automatically, enter your Transaction ID here.'=>'如果您的 Paddle 付款沒有自動註冊，請在此輸入您的交易 ID。','Illegal character in username.'=>'用戶名中有非法字符。','Image Indexing'=>'影像索引','Impact:'=>'影響：','Import'=>'進口','Import JSON File'=>'匯入 JSON 檔案','Important Tips'=>'重要提示','IMPORTANT!'=>'重要！','IMPORTANT! The forum registration form is probably under risk of spam attacks. Please configure wpForo built-in %s antibot for registration form to avoid spam registrations. If you don\'t use the forum registration form or you are sure that your registration forms are secured, just click on (x) button to dismiss this message.'=>'重要事項！論壇註冊表單可能有受到垃圾郵件攻擊的風險。請設定 wpForo 內建的 %s 反垃圾註冊表單，以避免垃圾註冊。如果您不使用論壇註冊表單或您確信您的註冊表單是安全的，只需點擊(x)按鈕即可解除此訊息。','IMPORTANT! Uninstall is not a simple deactivation action. This action will permanently remove all forum data (forums, topics, replies, attachments...) from database. Please backup database before this action, you may need this forum data in future. If you are sure that you want to delete all forum data please confirm. If not, just cancel it, then you can deactivate this plugin, that will not remove forum data.'=>'重要！卸載不是一個簡單的失活動作。此操作將永久刪除數據庫中的所有論壇數據（論壇、主題、答覆、附件…）。您可能還會需要這個論壇數據，請在這個動作之前備份。如果您確定要刪除所有論壇數據，請確認。如果不確認，就取消它，那麼你可以關閉這個插件，不會刪除論壇數據。','Important:'=>'重要：','IMPORTANT: wpForo can\'t work with default permalink, please change permalink structure'=>'特別注意：wpforo不能用默認的固定鏈接時，請改變固定鏈接結構','Improve content discovery with smart tag management. Complete tag management powered by AI. Automatically generates relevant tags for new and existing topics, removes outdated or irrelevant tags, maintains consistent tag vocabulary, identifies duplicate tags, and suggests related keywords. Self-cleaning system ensures your tag structure stays organized as your forum evolves while leaving existing topics untouched to preserve forum integrity.'=>'利用智慧標籤管理改善內容發現。由人工智能驅動的完整標籤管理。自動為新的和現有的主題產生相關標籤、移除過時或不相關的標籤、維持一致的標籤詞彙、識別重複標籤，以及建議相關關鍵字。自我清理系統可確保您的標籤結構隨著論壇的發展而保持有序，同時不碰觸現有主題，以保持論壇的完整性。','Improving'=>'改進','in %d day'=>'在 %d 天內' . "\0" . '','in %d hour'=>'在 %d 小時內' . "\0" . '','in %d min'=>'在 %d 分鐘內' . "\0" . '','in forum'=>'在論壇中','In most cases this is a server issue. We recommend you contact to your hosting service support team or open a support topic in wordpress.org support forum. Also there are many good articles regarding this issue in web. For example '=>'在大多數情況下，這是一個服務器問題。我們建議您與您的託管服務支持團隊聯繫，或在wordpress.org支持論壇中打開支持主題。在網上也有很多關於這個問題的好文章。例如','In most cases, this problem comes from your server file writing permissions. Files are not permitted to change, thus the forum color provider colors.css file is not updated with your changes. If you cannot fix this issue in hosting server, then the following easy steps can solve your problem:'=>'在大多數情況下，此問題來自您的服務器文件寫入權限。不允許更改文件，因此論壇顏色提供程序colors.css文件不會隨您的更改而更新。如果您無法在託管服務器中解決此問題，那麼以下簡單的步驟可以解決您的問題：','In the "Exclude Pages" section click the [Add New Rule] button'=>'在「排除頁面」區段中，按一下 [新增規則] 按鈕','In the table above (Usergroups) you can see the list of all available forum Usergroups. The first column of this table displays selected User Roles which are synched with certain Usergroup. However some User Roles are still not synced with any Usergroup of your forum. You can find not-synced User Roles in the table below (User Roles). If you use any of these not-synced User Roles and you want to grant some forum accesses to users of these User Roles you should create new Usergroups for each of them. Once new Usergroup is created, you should use the [Synchronize] button in the table above to synchronize User Roles with new Usergroups.'=>'在上表（用戶組）中，您可以看到所有可用論壇用戶組的列表。此表的第一列顯示與某個用戶組同步的所選用戶角色。但是，某些用戶角色仍未與論壇的任何用戶組同步。您可以在下表（用戶角色）中找到未同步的用戶角色。如果您使用這些未同步的用戶角色中的任何一個，並且您希望向這些用戶角色的用戶授予一些論壇訪問權限，則應為每個用戶角色創建新的用戶組。創建新的用戶組後，您應該使用上表中的[同步]按鈕將用戶角色與新用戶組同步。','Inactive'=>'禁用','Inactive and Banned'=>'閒置與禁用','Inactive and banned'=>'不活動和被禁止','Inactive users are the account owners who have no topics, posts, comments and subscriptions for new content. In 99&#37; cases this kind of accounts are being registered by Spammers. This tool allows you to only keep active and known inactive users.'=>'非活動用戶是沒有新內容的主題，帖子，評論和訂閱的帳戶所有者。 在99％的情況下，這種帳戶正在由垃圾郵件發送者註冊。 此工具允許您僅保留活動和已知的非活動用戶。','Inactive users who have been registered more than'=>'不活躍用戶註冊時間超過','Include custom post types in AI knowledge base for complete content coverage.'=>'在 AI 知識庫中包含自訂文章類型，以提供完整的內容涵蓋。','Include document attachments (PDF, DOCX, etc.) in indexing (Professional+ only). Credit cost: 1 per document page.'=>'在索引中包含文件附件 (PDF、DOCX 等)（僅限 Professional+）。信用成本：每頁文件 1。','Include images in indexing (Business/Enterprise). Posts with images will consume +1 credit.'=>'在索引中包含圖片 (商業/企業)。有圖片的文章將消耗 +1 信用。','Include images in indexing (Professional/Business/Enterprise only). Posts with images will consume +1 credit.'=>'在索引中包含圖片 (僅限專業/商務/企業)。有圖片的文章將消耗 +1 信用。','Include in Replies'=>'包含在回覆中','Include in Topics'=>'包含在主題中','Incorrect file format. Allowed formats: jpeg, jpg, png, gif.'=>'文件格式錯誤, 可用的格式：jpeg, jpg, png, gif.','Incorrect file type'=>'不正確的檔案類型','Index %s Topics (Using All Credits)'=>'索引 %s 主題 (使用所有學分)','Index all forum topics in one click. This will queue all topics for AI features. Only new or modified topics will consume credits - unchanged topics are skipped automatically.'=>'一鍵索引所有論壇主題。這會為 AI 功能排隊所有主題。只有新的或修改過的主題會消耗點數 - 未變更的主題會自動跳過。','Index All Topics'=>'索引所有主題','Index by Categories/Taxonomies'=>'依類別/分類標準索引','Index by Content Type'=>'依內容類型索引','Index by IDs'=>'依 ID 索引','Index Documents'=>'索引文件','Index Filtered Topics'=>'索引篩選主題','Index forum content to build a searchable vector database optimized for Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG). This feature transforms unstructured forum discussions, threads, and posts into semantic vectors, enabling AI that truly understands your domain, products, and audience.'=>'索引論壇內容，以建立可搜尋的向量資料庫，並針對 Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) 最佳化。此功能可將非結構化的論壇討論、主題和文章轉換為語意向量，讓人工智能真正了解您的領域、產品和受眾。','Index Images'=>'索引圖片','Index Remaining %s Topics'=>'索引剩餘 %s 標題','Index Selected Content'=>'索引選取的內容','Index Selected Forums'=>'索引所選論壇','Index Selected Terms'=>'索引 所選術語','Index Topics by Forums'=>'依論壇索引主題','Index topics using custom filters. Combine date range with other filters.'=>'使用自訂篩選條件索引主題。結合日期範圍與其他篩選條件。','Index WooCommerce products to provide AI-powered product search and support.'=>'索引 WooCommerce 產品，以提供 AI 驅動的產品搜尋與支援。','Index WordPress posts and pages for comprehensive site-wide AI search.'=>'索引 WordPress 帖子和頁面，以進行全面的全站 AI 搜索。','Index WordPress posts, pages, and custom post types to enable AI-powered search across all your site content. This works alongside forum content indexing.'=>'為 WordPress 的文章、頁面和自訂文章類型建立索引，以在您所有的網站內容中啟用 AI 驅動的搜尋功能。此功能可與論壇內容索引同時運作。','indexed'=>'索引','Indexing complete!'=>'索引編制完成！','Indexing configuration saved: Chunk size %d tokens, Overlap %d%%, Topics per batch %d.'=>'索引設定已儲存：Chunk size %d tokens, Overlap %d%%, Topics per batch %d。','Indexing in progress: %d of %d topics processed'=>'索引建立中：已處理 %d 標題中的 %d','Indexing Queue'=>'索引佇列','Indexing started! %1$d %2$s will be processed in batches of %3$d. Note: You have %4$d credits but need %5$d. Indexing will stop when credits run out.'=>'索引開始！%1$d %2$s 將以 %3$d 的批次處理。注意：您有 %4$d 點數，但需要 %5$d。索引將在點數用完時停止。','Indexing started! %1$d %2$s will be processed in batches of %3$d. You have %4$d credits available.'=>'索引開始！%1$d %2$s 將以 %3$d 的批次處理。您有 %4$d 可用點數。','Indexing Status'=>'索引狀態','Indexing stopped. %d scheduled jobs removed (%d topics will not be processed).'=>'索引停止。移除 %d 排程工作 (%d 主題將不會被處理)。','Indexing stopped: Insufficient credits. Please wait for your monthly reset or purchase additional credits.'=>'索引停止：點數不足。請等待每月重設或購買額外的點數。','Indexing...'=>'索引...','Indicators:'=>'指標：','Indonesian'=>'印尼語','Insert Forum Attachments to Media Library'=>'將論壇附件插入媒體庫','Insert image'=>'插入圖片','Insert link'=>'插入鏈接 ','Insert member name or email'=>'插入用戶名稱或電子郵件','Insert Spoiler'=>'插入擾流板','Insert the URL path(s) of your forum page(s) one per line in the option textarea:'=>'在選項文本區中每行插入一個論壇頁面的 URL 路徑：','Insert the URL path(s) of your forum page(s) one per line with wildcard (.*) in the option textarea:'=>'在選項文本區插入您論壇頁面的 URL 路徑，每行一個，帶通配符 (.*) ：','Insert the URL path(s) of your forum page(s) one per line with wildcard [*] in the option textarea:'=>'在選項文本區插入您論壇頁面的 URL 路徑，每行一個，帶通配符 [*]：','Insert the URL path(s) of your forum page(s) with wildcard [*] in the pop-up filed:'=>'在彈出式檔案中插入帶通配符 [*] 的論壇頁面 URL 路徑：','Insert your Email address.'=>'插入你的電郵地址。','Insight: Deep Analysis'=>'洞察力：深入分析','Insight: Recommendations'=>'洞察力：建議','Insight: Sentiment'=>'洞察力：情緒','Insight: Sentiment Trend'=>'洞察力：情緒趨勢','Insight: Trending'=>'洞察力：趨勢','Inspirational - Motivating and uplifting'=>'Inspirational - 激勵和振奮人心','Instagram'=>'Instagram','Install'=>'安裝','Installed'=>'已安裝','Insufficient credits'=>'學分不足','Insufficient credits to run this analysis.'=>'點數不足，無法執行此分析。','Insufficient permissions.'=>'權限不足。','Interview Style - Q&A format'=>'面試方式 - 問答形式','Invalid Email address'=>'無效的電郵地址','Invalid log ID'=>'無效的日誌 ID','Invalid message ID'=>'無效訊息 ID','Invalid request!'=>'無效的請求！','Invalid request.'=>'非法請求。','Invalid response from server. Please try again.'=>'來自伺服器的無效回應。請重試。','Invalid taxonomy or term'=>'無效的分類或術語','Invalid Topic ID or URL.'=>'無效的主題 ID 或 URL。','Invalid value'=>'無效值','IP Address'=>'IP 位址','is Default'=>'是默認的','is enabled'=>'已啟用','is not installed! For an advanced Spam Control please install Akismet antispam plugin, it works well with wpForo Spam Control system. Akismet is already integrated with wpForo. It\'ll help to filter posts and protect forum against spam attacks.'=>'尚未安裝！如欲獲取更高級的反垃圾控制請安裝 Akismet 插件，它將會和 wpForo Spam Control 系統一起工作。','is standalone'=>'是獨立的','Issues and Recommendations'=>'問題和建議','It allows users to export the configuration and settings data of the wpForo into a downloadable JSON file.'=>'它允許使用者將 wpForo 的組態與設定資料匯出成可下載的 JSON 檔案。','It allows users to import the configuration and settings data of the wpForo from already exported JSON file.'=>'它允許使用者從已匯出的 JSON 檔案匯入 wpForo 的設定與設定資料。','It\'s not what I was looking for'=>'這不是我想要的','Italian'=>'義大利語','item'=>'項目','Items'=>'項目','Items per Page'=>'每頁項目','Japanese'=>'日本語','Join Date Ascending'=>'加入日期遞增','Join Date Descending'=>'加入日期遞減','Join us today!'=>'今天加入我們的行列！','Join Us!'=>'加入我們','Joined'=>'已加入','Joined:'=>'已加入：','Jump to First Unread Post with [new] Button in Topic Link'=>'使用主題連結中的 [new] 按鈕跳至第一篇未讀文章','Just now'=>'現在','KB'=>'KB','Keep enabled this option to synch WordPress User Roles with Forum Usergroups. This connection allows to automatically change Usergroup of a user when his/her User Role is changed by administrators or by membership plugins. In other words this option allows to manage Usergroups based on Users Roles, thus you can directly control users forum accesses based on Users Roles. If this option is turned off, User Roles don\'t have any affection to users forum accesses, they are only controlled by forum Usergroups.'=>'保持啟用此選項以使WordPress用戶角色與論壇用戶組同步。此連接允許在管理員或成員資格插件更改用戶角色時自動更改用戶的用戶組。換句話說，此選項允許基於用戶角色管理用戶組，因此您可以根據用戶角色直接控制用戶論壇訪問。如果關閉此選項，則用戶角色對用戶論壇訪問沒有任何影響，它們僅由論壇用戶組控制。','Keep existing tags and add new ones. If unchecked, existing tags will be replaced.'=>'保留現有標籤並新增新標籤。如果未選取，現有標籤將被取代。','Keep Expanded Topic Overview in the Statistic Panel'=>'在統計面板中保留擴展的主題概述','Keep your forum active with AI-generated topics! The AI analyzes your existing discussions and automatically creates engaging threads based on your instructions every day or in any time period you want. Topics appear naturally from AI created users or pre-defined users, sparking fresh conversations. The AI can search for trending news and current issues related to your community, then create timely, relevant topics that drive engagement.'=>'使用 AI 產生的主題讓您的討論區保持活躍！AI 會分析您現有的討論，並根據您的指示每天或在您想要的任何時間段內自動建立吸引人的主題。主題會從 AI 創建的使用者或預先定義的使用者中自然出現，引發新鮮的對話。AI 可以搜尋與您社群相關的趨勢新聞和當前議題，然後創建及時、相關的話題來推動參與。','Keep your forum clean with intelligent spam detection. AI automatically identifies spam content after post submission, blocking malicious posts before they appear while learning from your moderation decisions to improve accuracy.'=>'使用智慧型垃圾郵件偵測功能，讓您的論壇保持乾淨。AI 可在文章提交後自動識別垃圾內容，在惡意文章出現之前就將其封鎖，同時從您的修改決策中學習，以提高準確性。','Keyword Sentiment Hotspots'=>'關鍵字情緒熱點','Keywords to help AI find topic inspiration from your forum content'=>'關鍵字可協助 AI 從您的論壇內容中找到主題靈感','Knowledge Source'=>'知識來源','Korean'=>'韓語','Language'=>'語言','Language for AI-generated content'=>'AI 產生內容的語言','Language XML file'=>'語言的XML文件','Larger chunk size = better context preservation, fewer vectors.'=>'較大的分塊大小 = 更好的上下文保存，較少的向量。','Last 24 Hours'=>'過去 24 小時','Last 24 hours'=>'最近24小時','Last 3 Months'=>'最近3個月','Last 30 Days'=>'最近 30 天','Last 30 days'=>'最近 30 天','Last 6 Months'=>'最近6個月','Last 7 Days'=>'最近 7 天','Last 90 Days'=>'最近 90 天','Last Active'=>'最近一次登錄','Last Activity'=>'最近活動','Last Hour'=>'最後一小時','Last Indexed'=>'最後索引','Last Login'=>'最後一次登入','Last Month'=>'上個月','Last Name'=>'姓氏','Last Online time'=>'最後上線時間','Last page'=>'最後一頁','Last Post'=>'最近一次發帖','Last post by %s'=>'最近由 %s 發的貼','Last Post Info'=>'最近一次發帖信息','Last reply by %s'=>'最後回復 %s','Last seen'=>'最後看到','Last Week'=>'最近一週','Last Year ago'=>'最近一年','Latest Post'=>'最新的帖子','Latvian'=>'拉脫維亞語','LAYOUTS'=>'布局','Leave a comment'=>'發表評論','Leave a reply'=>'留下回復','Leave empty to index all content of selected types.'=>'留空表示索引所有選取類型的內容。','Left'=>'左邊','left'=>'左邊','Length must be between 3 characters and 15 characters.'=>'長度必須介於3個字符和15個字符之間。','Length must be between 3 characters and 30 characters.'=>'長度必須在3個字符和15個字符之間。','Less'=>'更少','Level'=>'等級','Lifetime Credits Used'=>'已使用的終生信用額','Lifetime Total'=>'終生總計','like'=>'頂','Liked'=>'讚','liked'=>'混合','Liked Forum Posts'=>'喜歡論壇帖子','Liked Posts'=>'喜歡的帖子','Likes'=>'喜歡','Limit how many AI requests guests and logged-in users can make per day. Moderators are exempt from these limits.'=>'限制訪客和登入使用者每天可以提出多少個 AI 請求。版主不受這些限制。','Limit Per Topic'=>'限制每個主題','Limit Post Editing Information'=>'限制後期編輯信息','Limit the post edit logging information \'This post was modified 2 hours ago by John\'. Set this option value 0 if you want to disable limiting.'=>'限制文章編輯記錄資訊 \'This post was modified 2 hours ago by John\'。如果要停用限制，請將此選項值設定為 0。','Link Text'=>'鏈接文本','Link to confirm subscription'=>'確認訂閱的連結','Link to open password reset form'=>'開啟密碼重設表格的連結','Link to the post'=>'文章連結','Link to unsubscribe'=>'取消訂閱的連結','LinkedIn'=>'LinkedIn','Links to documentation'=>'文件連結','Links\' hover/active font color'=>'連結的懸浮/作用中字體顏色','List/Roundup - Curated collection'=>'清單/彙整 - 精選收藏','Lithuanian'=>'立陶宛語','Load More Activities'=>'載入更多活動','Load more replies...'=>'載入更多回覆...','Load More Topics'=>'加載更多主題','Loading analytics data...'=>'載入分析資料...','Loading chart data...'=>'載入圖表資料...','Loading logs...'=>'正在載入日誌...','Loading Topics'=>'載入主題','Loading usage data...'=>'載入使用資料...','Loading...'=>'載入中...','local'=>'本地','Local (WordPress Database)'=>'本地 (WordPress 資料庫)','Local (WordPress)'=>'本地 (WordPress)','Local embeddings cleared successfully.'=>'本地嵌入成功清除。','Local indexing stopped. %d topics removed from queue.'=>'本地索引停止。從佇列中移除 %d 主題。','Local storage is not available'=>'本地儲存不可用','Local storage keeps all data within your WordPress database. Recommended for forums with up to 100,000 posts.'=>'本機儲存可將所有資料保存在 WordPress 資料庫中。建議使用於文章數量高達 100,000 篇的論壇。','locale'=>'地區','Location'=>'位置','Log Details'=>'日誌詳細資訊','Log not found'=>'找不到日誌','Log Settings'=>'日誌設定','Log Viewed Forums and Topics'=>'記錄查看的論壇和主題','Login'=>'登錄','login'=>'登錄','Login &amp; Registration'=>'登入及註冊','login required'=>'需要登入','Login URL'=>'登錄鏈接','Logout'=>'退出','logout'=>'退出','Logs older than %d days will be auto