ber of Topics per Page'=>'每頁的話題數量','Number of topics to process per batch during indexing. Lower values are more reliable but slower. Higher values are faster but may timeout on slower servers. Default: 10'=>'索引期間每批要處理的主題數量。值越小越可靠，但速度越慢。較高的值較快，但在較慢的伺服器上可能會超時。預設值：10','Numerical nicknames are not allowed. Please insert another.'=>'不允許使用數字暱稱。請插入另一個。','Obtain personal data and created content'=>'獲取個人數據和創建內容','Occasional (2-9 posts)'=>'不定期 (2-9 個職位)','Occupation'=>'占用','of'=>'的','Offline'=>'離線','old password'=>'舊密碼','Old password is wrong'=>'舊密碼錯誤','Oldest'=>'最老的','Once activated, you will have %s free credits to get started with AI features.'=>'啟動後，您將有 %s 的免費點數，可以開始使用 AI 功能。','One manual run costs:'=>'一次手動運行的成本：','One of the selected Usergroups cannot be set as Secondary'=>'其中一個選定的用戶組不能設置為輔助組','One or more checkboxes must be selected.'=>'必須選取一個或多個核取方塊。','one URL per line'=>'每行一個鏈接','One User Role cannot be synched with multiple Usergroups.'=>'一個用戶角色無法與多個用戶組同步。','one-time'=>'一次性','One-time (1 post)'=>'一次性 (1 個職位)','Online'=>'在線','Online Members'=>'線上會員','Online status timeout'=>'在線狀態超時','Online Status Timeout (minutes)'=>'線上狀態逾時 (分鐘)','Only Admins and Moderators can see your private topics.'=>'僅有權用戶可查看私密話題。','Only Not Replied Topics'=>'僅未回覆主題','Only select topics that have no replies yet. Works with all filters.'=>'只選取尚未有回覆的主題。適用於所有篩選條件。','Only select topics that have no tags yet. Works with all filters.'=>'只選取尚未有標籤的主題。適用於所有篩選條件。','Only Topics Without Tags'=>'只有主題沒有標籤','Oops! The page you requested was not found!'=>'哎呀!沒找到您請求的頁面！','open'=>'打開','Open [AI Assistant] widget by Default on Home Page'=>'在首頁預設開啟 [AI 助理] widget','open a support ticket'=>'開立支援票','Open link in a new tab'=>'在新標籤中打開鏈接','Open Settings'=>'開啟設定','Open Support Ticket'=>'開啟支援票單','Opinion Piece - Personal perspective'=>'意見文章 - 個人觀點','Optional prefix added to topic titles'=>'在主題標題中加入可選前綴','Or index by specific IDs:'=>'或依特定 ID 索引：','Or select specific content to index:'=>'或選擇要索引的特定內容：','orange'=>'橙色','Order by'=>'訂購','Original'=>'原創','Other'=>'其他','Our newest member'=>'我們的新成員','overdue'=>'逾期','Overlap Percentage (%)'=>'重疊百分比 (%)','Overlap percentage must be between 5 and 50.'=>'重疊百分比必須介於 5 和 50 之間。','Overview'=>'概述','Overwrite WordPress New User Registration Email for Admins'=>'覆寫 WordPress 管理員的新使用者註冊電子郵件','Overwrite WordPress New User Registration Email for Users'=>'覆寫 WordPress 用戶的新使用者註冊電子郵件','Overwrite WordPress Reset Password Emails'=>'覆寫 WordPress 重設密碼電子郵件','Package'=>'包裝','Paddle (Credit Card, PayPal)'=>'槳（信用卡、PayPal）','Page'=>'頁','Page ID'=>'頁面 ID','Page URL to Website Privacy Policy'=>'指向網站隱私權政策的頁面 URL','Page URL to website privacy policy'=>'網站隱私權政策的頁面 URL','Page URL to Website Terms'=>'頁面 URL 至網站條款','Page URL to website terms'=>'頁面 URL 到網站條款','pageid'=>'pageid','Parent Forum'=>'父級論壇','Participants'=>'參與者','Password'=>'密碼','Password length must be between %d characters and %d characters.'=>'密碼長度必須介於%d個字符和%d個字符之間。','Password length must be between 6 characters and 20 characters.'=>'密碼長度必須在6個字符和20個字符之間。','Password mismatch.'=>'密碼不匹配。','Password successfully changed'=>'密碼修改成功','Pause'=>'暫停','Pause Selected'=>'暫停選取','Paused'=>'已暫停','Pay only for what you use with flexible credit-based pricing. Credits roll over month-to-month as long as you have an active subscription plan. Each plan allows credit accumulation up to one year of subscription plan credits. Start with 500 free credits, then choose a plan that fits your forum\'s activity level.'=>'使用靈活的信用額定價，只需支付您使用的費用。只要您有使用中的訂閱方案，點數就會逐月累積。每個計劃允許累積最多一年的訂閱計劃點數。從 500 個免費點數開始，然後選擇適合您論壇活動程度的方案。','Payment and Subscription Management is Powered by Freemius - Secure Checkout'=>'付款和訂閱管理由 Freemius 提供 - 安全結帳','Payment and Subscription Management is Powered by Paddle - Secure Checkout'=>'付款和訂閱管理由 Paddle 提供 - 安全結帳','Payment Method:'=>'付款方式：','Payment: %s'=>'付款：%s','Peak Days:'=>'高峰日：','Peak Hours:'=>'高峰時段：','pending'=>'待定','Percentage of overlap between consecutive chunks. Helps maintain context across chunk boundaries. Default: 20%'=>'連續資料塊之間的重疊百分比。有助於跨區塊邊界維持上下文。預設值：20','Permalinks'=>'永久連結','Permission denied'=>'權限不足','Permission denied for add forum'=>'無權添加論壇','Permission denied for delete forum'=>'無權刪除論壇','Permission denied for edit forum'=>'無權編輯論壇','Permission denied for this action'=>'無權進行此操作','Permissions'=>'權限','Personal account manager for strategic guidance and priority assistance.'=>'個人客戶經理提供策略指導和優先協助。','Personalized greeting (e.g., "Hi John")'=>'個人化的問候語（例如：「嗨，約翰）','Phrase add error'=>'短語添加錯誤','Phrase adding error'=>'短語添加錯誤','Phrase successfully added'=>'短語添加成功','Phrase successfully updates'=>'短語更新成功','Phrase update error'=>'短語更新錯誤','phrase_key'=>'phrase_key','phrase_value'=>'phrase_value','Phrases'=>'短語','Playful - Fun and lighthearted'=>'Playful - 輕鬆有趣','Please %s if you believe this is an error or if you need assistance reactivating your account.'=>'如果您認為這是一個錯誤，或需要協助重新啟動您的帳戶，請 %s。','Please %s or %s'=>'請 %s 或 %s','Please choose one reasons before sending a feedback!'=>'請在發送反饋之前選擇一個原因！','Please confirm subscription to [entry_title]'=>'請確認訂閱[entry_title]','Please confirm you want to do this action?'=>'請確認您要執行此動作？','Please connect to AI service to view logs.'=>'請連線至 AI 服務檢視記錄。','Please connect to wpForo AI API  first in the Overview tab to enable AI Content Indexing.'=>'請先在總覽頁籤中連線至 wpForo AI API 以啟用 AI 內容索引。','Please connect to wpForo AI API first in the Overview tab to enable AI Tasks.'=>'請先在總覽頁籤中連線到 wpForo AI API 來啟用 AI 任務。','Please connect to wpForo AI API first in the Overview tab to enable Analytics.'=>'請先在總覽頁籤中連線到 wpForo AI API 來啟用分析功能。','Please connect to wpForo AI API first in the Overview tab to enable WordPress Content Indexing.'=>'請先在概述索引標籤中連線至 wpForo AI API，以啟用 WordPress 內容索引。','Please contact the forum administratoristrator to delete it.'=>'請聯繫論壇管理員刪除它。','Please contact the forum administratoristrator to edit it.'=>'請聯繫論壇管理員進行編輯。','Please contact to your hosting service support team and ask them enable PHP cURL module'=>'請聯繫您的託管服務支持團隊，並要求他們啟用PHP cURL模塊
未啟用','Please copy the target topic URL from browser address bar and paste in the field below.'=>'請從瀏覽器地址欄複製目標主題URL並粘貼到下面的字段中。','Please drag and drop forum panels to set parent-child hierarchy.'=>'請拖放論壇面板來設置父子層次結構。','Please enable mod_rewrite on your server, this is required for wpForo forum'=>'請在您的服務器上啟用mod_rewrite，這是wpForo論壇所必需的
問題和建議','Please enable this option to help wpForo get more popularity as your thank to the hard work we do for you totally free. This option adds a very small icon in forum footer, which will allow your site visitors recognize the name of forum solution you use.'=>'請啟用此選項將幫助wpforo獲得更多的人氣和辛勤工作，我們為你完全做免費的。此選項在論壇腳註中添加了一個非常小的圖標，這將允許您的網站訪問者識別您使用的論壇解決方案的名稱。','Please exclude the forum page from your cache plugin! wpForo has a built-in cache system. It does dynamic cache of all forum pages, which will be affected by your cache plugin and the forum data will not be updated on the front-end. The user login and logout actions will also be corrupted.'=>'請從您的快取外掛排除論壇頁面！wpForo 有內建的快取系統。它會對所有論壇頁面進行動態緩存，這將會受到您的緩存插件的影響，論壇資料將不會在前端更新。用戶登錄和登出動作也會被損壞。','Please execute this SQL in your Website Hosting cPanel > phpMyAdmin Database Manager'=>'請在您的網站託管cPanel> phpMyAdmin數據庫管理器中執行此SQL','Please fill your email address for feedback'=>'請填寫您的電子郵件地址以獲取反饋','Please find more information here: '=>'請在此瞭解更多資訊：','Please insert required fields'=>'請插入必填字段','Please insert required fields!'=>'請插入所需的字段！','Please insert URLs to your website Terms and Conditions. Links to these pages will be included in registration form checkbox label (I\'m agree with website terms and privacy policy).'=>'請插入 URL 至您的網站條款與條件。這些網頁的連結將包含在註冊表單的核取方塊標籤中 (我同意網站條款與隱私權政策)。','Please insert URLs to your website Terms and Privacy Policy pages. Links to these pages will be included in registration form checkbox label (I\'m agree with website terms and privacy policy) and in Forum Privacy Policy. The forum Privacy Policy does not cover your whole website, it is just an extension of your website main Privacy Policy. Thus it should be linked to according pages.'=>'請將URL插入您的網站條款和隱私政策頁面。這些頁面的鏈接將包含在註冊表格複選框標籤（我同意網站條款和隱私政策）和論壇隱私政策中。論壇隱私政策不涵蓋您的整個網站，它只是您網站主要隱私政策的延伸。因此，它應該與相關頁面相關聯。','Please Insert Your Email or Username'=>'請插入您的電子郵件或用戶名','Please let us know why you are deactivating. Choosing one of the options below you will help us make it better for you and for other users.'=>'請告訴我們您停用的原因。選擇以下選項之一，將有助於我們為您和其他用戶提供更好的選擇。','Please make sure the Akismet plugin installed and the Akismet API keys are configured.'=>'請確定已安裝 Akismet 外掛程式，並已設定 Akismet API 金鑰。','Please make sure you don\'t have not-synched Roles in the "User Roles'=>'請確保“用戶角色”中沒有未同步的角色','Please make sure you don\'t have not-synched Roles in the \\"User Roles'=>'請確定您的 \\「使用者角色 」中沒有未同步的角色。','Please Moderate: '=>'請修正:','Please navigate in Dashboard to LiteSpeed Cache > Cache admin page'=>'請在儀表板中導航至 LiteSpeed Cache > 快取管理頁面','Please navigate in Dashboard to Performance > Page Cache admin page'=>'請在儀表板中導航至效能 > 頁面快取管理頁面','Please navigate in Dashboard to Settings > WP Super Cache'=>'請在儀表板中導航至設定 > WP Super Cache','Please navigate in Dashboard to SG Optimizer > Caching admin page'=>'請在儀表板中導航至 SG 優化 > 快取管理頁面','Please navigate in Dashboard to WP Fastest Cache > Exclude Tab'=>'請在儀表板中導航至 WP Fastest Cache > 排除索引標籤','Please navigate in Dashboard to WP Rocket > Advanced Rules Tab'=>'請在儀表板中導航至 WP Rocket > 進階規則標籤','Please navigate in Dashboard to WP-Optimize > Cache admin page'=>'請在儀表板中導航至 WP-Optimize > 快取管理頁面','Please navigate to Settings > Autoptimize > Main Tab, click on top right [Show advanced settings] button, find "Exclude scripts from Autoptimize" option, add this JS path <code>,wp-includes/js/tinymce</code>, than click on [Save Changes and Empty Cache] button bellow.'=>'請導航到設置>自動優化>主選項卡，單擊右上角[顯示高級設置]按鈕，找到“從自動優化中排除腳本”選項，添加此JS路徑<code>，wp-includes / js / tinymce </ code>，然後單擊[保存更改並清空緩存]按鈕。','Please navigate to wpForo > Overview admin page and click the [Rebuild Phrases] button'=>'請瀏覽 wpForo > 總覽 管理頁面，然後按一下 [重建詞組] 按鈕。','Please note that boards are separate forum pages, you can use them if you want to have more than one forum in your website. Also, you can use boards to create separate forums for different languages. If you want to add a new category or forum, please use the Forums menu under the menu section of existing discussion boards.'=>'請注意，討論區是獨立的版面，如果您想在您的網站上擁有一個以上的討論區，您可以使用討論區。此外，您也可以使用討論區為不同的語言建立獨立的版面。如果您想要新增一個新的分類或討論區，請使用現有討論區功能表下的論壇功能表。','Please note, that forums can be displayed with different layouts %1$s, just edit the top category (blue panel) and set %2$s. Child forums inherit the top category (blue panel) layout.'=>'請注意，論壇可以用不同的版面 %1$s 顯示，只要編輯頂部類別 (藍色面板) 並設定 %2$s。子版面會繼承頂部類別 (藍色面板) 的版面設計。','Please note, that this option is only related to wpForo cookies. This doesn\'t disable WordPress and other plugins cookies. wpForo stores a small amount of data in cookies, it used to track visited forums and topics (bold and normal titles). Also when a guest (not registered user) creates a topic or post a reply, wpForo stores guest name and email address in cookies. wpForo uses this information to detect current guest content (topics, posts) and display it to the guest even if the content is under moderation (not approved by moderators). Also wpForo stores guest name and email in cookies to keep filled these fields when he/she posts a new reply or creates a new topic.'=>'請注意，此選項僅與wpForo cookie有關。這不會禁用WordPress和其他插件cookie。 wpForo在cookie中存儲少量數據，用於跟蹤訪問過的論壇和主題（粗體和普通標題）。此外，當訪客（非註冊用戶）創建主題或發布回復時，wpForo會將訪客姓名和電子郵件地址存儲在cookie中。 wpForo使用此信息來檢測當前訪客內容（主題，帖子）並將其顯示給訪客，即使內容處於審核狀態（未經主持人批准）。此外，wpForo會將客人姓名和電子郵件存儲在Cookie中，以便在他/她發布新回復或創建新主題時保留這些字段。','Please provide a plugin name or URL'=>'請提供插件名稱或URL','Please provide a Topic ID or URL.'=>'請提供主題 ID 或 URL。','Please provide at least one filter (date range, tags, user IDs, or specific topics).'=>'請提供至少一個篩選條件 (日期範圍、標籤、使用者 ID 或特定主題)。','Please provide more information'=>'請提供更多信息','Please renew your subscription to continue using AI features.'=>'請更新您的訂閱，以繼續使用 AI 功能。','Please save "Forum template slugs'=>'請保存“論壇模板 slugs','Please select a target forum'=>'請選擇目標論壇','Please select at least one forum to clear.'=>'請至少選擇一個論壇進行清除。','Please select at least one forum to index.'=>'請至少選擇一個論壇建立索引。','Please select at least one post to split'=>'請選擇至少一個要拆分的帖子','Please select users and usergroup'=>'請選擇使用者和使用者群組','Please use the contact form below if you want to contact the website administrator.'=>'如果您要聯絡網站管理員，請使用下面的聯絡表單。','plugin'=>'插頭','Plugin Usage Feedback'=>'插件使用反饋','plugin.'=>'插件。','Points for One Dislike'=>'一個不喜歡的點數','Points for One Like'=>'點一個讚','Points for One Post'=>'一篇文章的點數','Points for One Topic'=>'一個主題的分數','Policy Compliance'=>'政策遵循','Policy Violations'=>'違反政策','Polish'=>'波蘭語','POPULAR'=>'熱門','Popular'=>'熱門','Popular Tags'=>'熱門標籤','Portuguese'=>'葡萄牙語','Positive'=>'正面','Possible Spam Attachments'=>'可能的垃圾附件','Possibly relevant'=>'可能相關','Post #%d'=>'張貼 #%d','Post author display name'=>'貼文作者顯示名稱','Post Content'=>'評論內容','Post content font color'=>'貼文內容字型顏色','Post content font size:'=>'貼文內容字型大小：','Post delete error'=>'帖子刪除錯誤','Post is empty'=>'帖子是空的','Post link'=>'帖子鏈接','Post list head panel background color'=>'文章清單頭部面板背景顏色','Post Moderation'=>'崗位管理','post not found'=>'帖子沒找到','Post options reset successfully'=>'發布選項重置成功','Post options successfully updated'=>'成功更新帖子選項','Post options successfully updated, but previous value not changed'=>'成功更新帖子選項，但前一個值沒有更改','Post Preview'=>'發表預覽','Post Preview and Auto Drafting'=>'貼文預覽與自動繪製','Post Reporting Emails'=>'帖子報告郵件','Post Revisions and Draft Saving'=>'修正後與草稿儲存','Post Sharing Toggle'=>'分享後切換','Post sharing toggle allows you to share posts individually. You can see post sharing toggles on the left, right side or in top bar of each post. The toggle blue color is the current primary color (#12) of your forum style. For example, if you use the red forum style, the color of all share toggles will be red. This doesn\'t affect share button colors. They are always gray with original colors on mouse hover.'=>'帖子共享切換允許您單獨分享帖子。您可以在每個帖子的左側，右側或頂部欄中看到帖子共享切換。切換藍色是論壇樣式的當前主要顏色（＃12）。例如，如果您使用紅色論壇樣式，則所有共享切換的顏色將為紅色。這不會影響共享按鈕顏色。鼠標懸停時，它們始終為灰色，帶有原始顏色。','Post Sharing Toggle Icon'=>'貼文分享切換圖示','Post Sharing Toggle Locations'=>'貼文分享切換位置','Post Sharing Toggle View'=>'貼文分享切換檢視','Post Title'=>'帖子主題','Post was automatically held for moderation because the author 