准的主題會在核准時自動編入索引。','Probably spam file attachments have been detected by wpForo Spam Control. Please moderate suspected files in wpForo &gt; Settings &gt; Spam Protection.'=>'wpForo Spam Control可能檢測到垃圾郵件文件附件。請在論壇中調整可疑文件  &gt; 工具 &gt; 反垃圾郵件標籤。','Problem description'=>'問題描述','Problem fixer SQL commands:'=>'問題修復程序SQL命令：','Problem/Solution - Issues and fixes'=>'問題/解決方案 - 問題與修正','Problems Found in Database'=>'數據庫中發現的問題','Problems with colors?'=>'顏色問題？','Processed %d of %d topics...'=>'已處理 %d 主題中的 %d...','Professional'=>'專業','Professional - Business-like and formal'=>'專業 - 具商業氣息且正式','Professional Features'=>'專業功能','Profile'=>'資料','Profile Account'=>'檔案帳戶','Profile Activity'=>'資料活動','Profile Home'=>'簡介主頁','Profile Page'=>'簡介頁面','Profile Subscriptions'=>'個人資料訂閱','Profile updated successfully'=>'資料更新成功','Protect your community from harmful content with advanced toxicity detection. AI analyzes posts for hate speech, harassment, personal attacks, threats, and other toxic behavior. Configurable severity thresholds let you set how aggressively to filter content, while automated actions like unapproval or user banning help maintain a respectful environment without constant manual moderation.'=>'利用先進的毒性偵測功能，保護您的社群遠離有害內容。AI 會分析文章中的仇恨言論、騷擾、人身攻擊、威脅和其他有毒害性的行為。可設定的嚴重性臨界值可讓您設定過濾內容的強烈程度，而取消批核或封鎖使用者等自動動作有助於維持一個尊重他人的環境，而無需持續進行手動修改。','Protect your forum from spam user registration!'=>'保護您的論壇免於垃圾使用者註冊！','Provide Context - Background info'=>'提供背景 - 背景資訊','public'=>'公開的','Public Search'=>'公開搜尋','Publish'=>'發布','Published'=>'已公開','Purchase New Plan'=>'購買新計劃','Q&A Forum Layout'=>'問與答論壇版面','Q&A Layout - Comment Form Type'=>'問答布局 - 評論表格類型','Q&A Layout - Display Add Topic Button on Forum List'=>'問與答版面 - 在論壇列表上顯示新增主題按鈕','Q&A Layout - Display Answer Editor'=>'問答布局 - 顯示答案編輯器','Q&A Layout - Enable Comments on the First Post (question)'=>'問與答版面 - 啟用第一篇文章的評論 (問題)','Q&A layout - Intro topics'=>'Q&A布局 -介紹話題','Q&A Layout - Number of Answers per Page'=>'問答布局 - 每頁答案數','Q&A Layout - Number of Comments per Answer'=>'問與答版面 - 每個答案的註解數量','Q&A Layout - Number of intro topics'=>'Q&A布局 - 介紹話題的數量','Q&A Layout - Number of Recent topics'=>'問答布局 - 最近主題的數量','Q&A Layout - Recent topic length'=>'問答布局 - 最近的主題長度','Q&A Layout - Recent topics'=>'問答布局 - 最近的主題','Quality Tier'=>'品質層級','Query'=>'查詢','Question'=>'問題','Question - Asking for help/opinions'=>'問題 - 求助/意見','Question Comments'=>'問題評論','Question Status'=>'問題狀態','Question Tags'=>'問題標籤','Questions'=>'問題','Queue Processing'=>'佇列處理','queued...'=>'已排隊...','Quick Answer - Brief response'=>'快速回答 - 簡短回應','Quote'=>'引用','Quote this text'=>'引述這段文字','RAG database has been cleared successfully. All indexed data has been removed.'=>'RAG 資料庫已成功清除。所有索引資料已移除。','Random'=>'隨機','Random selection excludes private, closed, and unapproved topics.'=>'隨機選擇不包括私人、封閉和未經核准的主題。','Random topic from selected forums (excludes private, closed, unapproved)'=>'從選定的論壇中隨機抽取主題（不包括私人、封閉、未核准的主題）','Randomly selects a user from this group for each generated topic.'=>'針對每個已產生的主題，隨機從此群組中選取一位使用者。','Randomly selects a user from this group for each reply (avoids replying as the topic author).'=>'每次回覆時從該群組中隨機選取一位使用者 (避免以主題作者的身份回覆)。','Range: 1-50'=>'範圍：1-50','Range: 100-1024 tokens'=>'範圍：100-1024 代幣','Range: 5-50%'=>'範圍：5-50%','Rate Limiting'=>'速率限制','Rating'=>'等級','Rating Badge'=>'等級徽章','Rating Color'=>'級別顏色','Rating Icon'=>'級別圖標','Rating Level'=>'等級','Rating Title'=>'評級的標題','RE'=>'答覆','Re-Index All %s Topics'=>'重新索引所有 %s 主題','Re-Index All Topics'=>'重新索引所有主題','Re-Index Topic Images'=>'重新索引主題圖片','Re-indexing failed: %s'=>'重新索引失敗：%s','Re-indexing started! %d topics have been queued for processing with chunk size %d and %d%% overlap. This will run in the background.'=>'重新索引開始！%d 個主題已排隊等待處理，主塊大小為 %d，重疊率為 %d%%。這將在背景中執行。','Re-indexing started! %d topics with images have been queued for processing. This will run in the background.'=>'重新索引開始！%d 有圖片的主題已排隊等待處理。這將在背景中執行。','reacted to'=>'反應','reacted to %1$s\'s post in the topic %2$s'=>'對 %1$s 在主題 %2$s 中發表的文章作出了回應','reacted to a post in the topic %s'=>'回應了主題 %s 中的一個帖子','Reactions'=>'反應','Read more'=>'閱讀更多','Read more about Facebook public_profile properties.'=>'詳細了解Facebook公開個人資料。','Read only access'=>'只讀訪問','Read the documentation'=>'閱讀文檔','Reason (optional):'=>'原因（選擇性）：','Rebuild Phrases'=>'重建短語','Rebuild Threads'=>'重建線程','Rebuilt Successfully!'=>'重建成功！','reCAPTCHA API Keys'=>'reCAPTCHA API密鑰','reCAPTCHA protects you against spam and other types of automated abuse. It secures topic and post editors when Guest Posting is allowed, and protects login and registration forms against spam attacks. wpForo supports reCAPTCHA v2 (Checkbox and Invisible) and v3 (score-based, invisible).'=>'reCAPTCHA 保護您免受垃圾郵件和其他類型的自動濫用。wpForo 支援 reCAPTCHA v2 (Checkbox and Invisible) 及 v3 (score-based, invisible)。','reCAPTCHA Theme'=>'reCAPTCHA主題','reCAPTCHA Version'=>'reCAPTCHA 版本','Received Dislikes'=>'收到不喜歡','Received Likes'=>'收到的讚','Recent Activity'=>'最近活動','Recent Activity Timeline'=>'最近活動時間軸','Recent Posts'=>'最新帖子','Recent Posts Display Type'=>'最近的帖子顯示類型','Recent Questions'=>'最近的問題','Recent Topics'=>'最近的話題','Recently Added'=>'最近添加的','Recently viewed by users: %s.'=>'用戶最近瀏覽: %s.','Recheck DB'=>'重新檢查數據庫','Recommendation - Suggest specific action'=>'建議 - 提出具體行動','red'=>'紅色','Refer topics to first unread post'=>'參考主題至第一篇未讀文章','Refresh'=>'刷新','Refresh Analysis'=>'刷新分析','Refresh Status'=>'刷新狀態','Refreshed new theme with the brand new Boxed Layout for a clean, card-based forum experience.'=>'焕然一新的新主题，采用全新的盒式布局，提供简洁的卡片式论坛体验。','Refreshing...'=>'令人耳目一新...','Register'=>'註冊','register'=>'註冊','Register URL'=>'註冊鏈接','Register your site and get API keys here &raquo;'=>'註冊您的網站並獲取API密鑰&raquo;','Registered'=>'已註冊用戶','Registered date'=>'註冊日期','Registered user email'=>'註冊使用者電子郵件','Registered user login'=>'註冊使用者登入','Registration Error'=>'註冊錯誤','Related Topics'=>'相關話題','relevance'=>'關聯','Relevancy'=>'關聯','Relevant'=>'相關','remaining'=>'剩余的','Remaining Credits'=>'剩餘學分','Remaining to Index:'=>'剩餘索引：','Remember Me'=>'記住我','Remove Duplicate Tags'=>'移除重複標籤','Remove image'=>'移除影像','Remove Irrelevant Tags'=>'移除不相關的標籤','Remove tags that are not relevant to the topic content'=>'移除與主題內容無關的標籤','removed link'=>'已刪鏈接','Renews %s'=>'更新 %s','Repair'=>'維修','Repeat new password'=>'重複新密碼','Replace Author Avatar with Forum Profile Avatar'=>'替換作者頭像為論壇的資料頭像','Replace Author Link to Forum Profile'=>'替換作者鏈接為論壇的資料','Replace Comment Author Link to Forum Profile'=>'替換評論鏈接為論壇的資料','Replace Login Page URL to Forum Login Page URL'=>'將登錄頁面URL替換為論壇登錄頁面URL','Replace Registration Page URL to Forum Registration Page URL'=>'將註冊頁面URL替換為論壇註冊頁面URL','Replace Reset Password Page URL to Forum Reset Password Page URL'=>'將重置密碼頁面URL替換為論壇重置密碼頁面URL
