he pending post queue, cron jobs and cached status. Already-indexed posts are NOT affected.'=>'重設卡住的 WordPress 索引階段？這會清除待處理的文章佇列、cron 工作和快取狀態。已索引的文章不受影響。','Resolved'=>'已解決','Resource Collection - Useful links/tools'=>'資源收集 - 有用的連結/工具','Resource Sharing - Links/references'=>'資源分享 - 連結/參考資料','Response'=>'回應','Response Guidelines'=>'回應指引','Response Summary'=>'回應摘要','REST API Access'=>'REST API 存取','Restore'=>'還原','Restore Revision'=>'還原修訂','Result Info'=>'結果信息','Results are stored permanently until you click "Refresh" to get updated analysis. A warning will appear after 15 days to indicate data may be outdated.'=>'結果會永久儲存，直到您按一下「Refresh」（重新整理）以取得更新的分析結果。15 天後會出現警告，表示資料可能過時。','Results below this threshold are filtered out. For local storage, the threshold is automatically scaled (divided by 3) with a minimum of 15% to prevent irrelevant results. Recommended: 30%.'=>'低於此臨界值的結果會被篩選出來。對於本機儲存，臨界值會自動調整 (除以 3)，最低為 15%，以避免不相關的結果。建議：30%.','Retry Connection'=>'重試連線','Review - Product/service evaluation'=>'檢討 - 產品/服務評估','Revision'=>'修訂','Revisions'=>'修訂','Rich Editor Toolbar Location'=>'豐富編輯器工具列位置','Right'=>'亮','right'=>'對','Role Name'=>'角色名稱','Role-Usergroup Synchronization'=>'角色 - 用戶組同步','Role-Usergroup synchronization is complete!'=>'角色 - 用戶組同步已完成！','Role-Usergroup Synchronization is Turned ON!'=>'角色 - 用戶組同步已打開！','Romanian'=>'羅馬尼亞語','RSS'=>'RSS訂閱','RSS (Rich Site Summary; originally RDF Site Summary; often called Really Simple Syndication) uses a family of standard web feed formats to publish frequently updated information like new topics in forums, new posts in topics. An RSS document (called “feed”, “web feed”, or “channel”) includes topic and post  titles/links/excerpt publishing date and author’s name.'=>'RSS (Rich Site Summary; 原為 RDF Site Summary; 常稱為 Really Simple Syndication) 使用一系列標準的 web feed 格式來發佈頻繁更新的資訊，例如論壇中的新主題、主題中的新文章。RSS 文件（稱為「饋送」、「網頁饋送」或「頻道」）包括主題和文章標題/連結/摘錄的發佈日期和作者姓名。','Rule Compliance'=>'遵守規則','Rule Compliance & Policy Enforcement'=>'規則遵循與政策執行','Rule-based'=>'基於規則','Run AI Analysis'=>'執行 AI 分析','Run Analysis'=>'運行分析','Run Now'=>'立即執行','Run on each approved post'=>'在每個核准的職位上執行','Run on each approved topic'=>'在每個已核准的主題上執行','Russian'=>'俄語','Sad'=>'悲傷','Sat'=>'星期六','Save'=>'保存','save'=>'保存','Save Changes'=>'保存更改','Save Configuration'=>'儲存組態','Save Draft'=>'儲存草稿','Save forums order and hierarchy'=>'保存論壇順序和層次結構','Save it and delete all caches.'=>'儲存並刪除所有快取記憶體。','Save Options'=>'儲存選項','Save Options for All Boards'=>'儲存所有板卡的選項','Save Preferences'=>'儲存偏好設定','Save rules and delete all caches.'=>'儲存規則並刪除所有快取記憶體。','Save Task'=>'儲存任務','Saved'=>'儲存','Saving Draft'=>'儲存草稿','Scale your AI capabilities with cloud-based vector storage powered by AWS S3 Vectors. Ideal for large forums with thousands of posts and growing communities. Cloud storage provides unlimited scalability, faster query performance, automatic backups, and enterprise-grade reliability for your AI knowledge base.'=>'利用 AWS S3 Vectors 提供的雲端向量儲存擴充您的 AI 能力。非常適合擁有數以千計文章和不斷成長社群的大型論壇。雲端儲存為您的 AI 知識庫提供無限擴充能力、更快的查詢效能、自動備份以及企業級可靠性。','Schedule'=>'時間表','Scheduling'=>'排程','Score:'=>'得分：','Score: %d%%'=>'得分：%d%%','Score: -'=>'得分: -','Screen Layout'=>'屏幕布局','Screen Options'=>'屏幕選項','Scroll down to "Never cache (URLs)" option'=>'向下捲動至「永不快取 (URL) 」選項','Scroll to Advanced section and insert the URL path(s) of your forum page(s) one per line in the "Never cache the following pages" textarea:'=>'捲動到「進階」部分，然後在「絕不快取下列網頁」文字區域中，每行插入一個您論壇頁面的 URL 路徑：','Scroll to Exclude URLs from Caching section and click the "pencil" button, enable it, and click the button again'=>'捲動至將 URL 排除在快取記憶體部分，然後按一下「鉛筆」按鈕，啟用後再按一下按鈕','Search'=>'搜索','Search by username, display name, or email. Only activated users are shown.'=>'依使用者名稱、顯示名稱或電子郵件搜尋。僅顯示已啟用的使用者。','Search Enhancement'=>'搜尋功能增強','Search Entire Posts'=>'搜索全部帖子','Search Forums...'=>'搜索論壇......','Search in date period'=>'按日期區間搜索','Search in Forums'=>'搜索論壇','Search Keywords for Ideas'=>'搜尋構想的關鍵字','Search logs...'=>'搜尋日誌...','Search Phrase'=>'搜索短語','Search Query'=>'搜尋查詢','Search Response Language'=>'搜尋回應語言','Search result for'=>'搜索結果 ','Search Results'=>'搜尋結果','Search tasks...'=>'搜尋任務...','Search Titles Only'=>'僅搜索標題','Search Type'=>'搜索類型 ','Search...'=>'搜索...','Secondary Groups'=>'次級群組','Secondary Usergroup'=>'次要使用者群組','Secure Payment Processing'=>'安全付款處理','Security check failed'=>'安全檢查失敗','Security check failed. Please try again.'=>'安全檢查失敗。請再試一次。','Select [Start with] option in the drop-down menu and insert the URL path(s) of your forum page(s) one per rule in the next field:'=>'在下拉式功能表中選擇 [開始於] 選項，然後在下一個欄位中插入您論壇頁面的 URL 路徑，每條規則一個：','Select a taxonomy and term to index all content in that category.'=>'選取分類和術語，以索引該類別中的所有內容。','Select a taxonomy first to load terms...'=>'先選擇一個分類系統來載入詞彙...','Select a taxonomy...'=>'選擇分類...','Select a topic prefix from wpForo Topic Prefix addon'=>'從 wpForo Topic Prefix 附加元件中選擇主題前綴','Select All'=>'全選','Select Color'=>'選擇顏色','Select content types and optionally filter by date range.'=>'選擇內容類型，並可選擇依日期範圍篩選。','Select Forum'=>'選擇論壇','Select forums to process topic tags, or specify exact topic IDs. Both can be combined.'=>'選擇論壇來處理主題標籤，或指定確切的主題 ID。兩者可結合使用。','Select forums to reply to random topics, or specify exact topic IDs. Both can be combined for random selection between them.'=>'選擇要隨機回覆主題的討論區，或指定確切的主題 ID。兩者可結合使用，以便在兩者之間隨機選擇。','Select forums where new topics will be created'=>'選擇要建立新主題的版面','Select one or more forums to index their topics. Use date range to filter by topic creation date.'=>'選取一個或多個討論區以索引其主題。使用日期範圍依主題建立日期篩選。','Select Page'=>'選擇頁面 ','Select Posts to Split'=>'選擇要拆分的帖子','Select task type...'=>'選擇任務類型...','Select the AI model quality for bot replies. Higher quality provides better responses but uses more credits.'=>'選擇機器人回覆的 AI 模型品質。品質越高，回覆效果越好，但使用的點數也越多。','Select the AI model quality for content translation. Higher quality provides better translations but uses more credits.'=>'選擇內容翻譯的 AI 模型品質。品質越高，翻譯效果越好，但使用的點數也越多。','Select the AI model quality for generating search summaries and recommendations. Higher quality provides better synthesis but uses more credits.'=>'選擇用於產生搜尋摘要和建議的 AI 模型品質。較高的品質可提供較佳的綜合效果，但會使用較多的點數。','Select the AI model quality for generating topic suggestions. Higher quality provides better suggestions but uses more credits.'=>'選擇產生主題建議的 AI 模型品質。品質越高，提供的建議越好，但使用的點數也越多。','Select the AI model quality for generating topic summaries. Higher quality provides better summaries but uses more credits.'=>'選擇用於產生主題摘要的 AI 模型品質。較高的品質可提供較好的摘要，但會使用較多的點數。','Select the AI model quality for search re-ranking. Higher quality uses more credits per search.'=>'選擇搜尋重新排序的 AI 模型品質。品質越高，每次搜尋使用的點數越多。','Select the AI model quality for spam detection. Higher quality provides more accurate detection but uses more credits.'=>'選擇偵測垃圾郵件的 AI 模型品質。品質越高，偵測越精確，但使用的點數也越多。','Select the default AI model quality for chatbot responses. Higher quality provides better responses but uses more credits per message.'=>'選擇聊天機器人回應的預設 AI 模型品質。品質越高，回覆效果越好，但每則訊息使用的點數也越多。','Select the default language for AI-generated search responses. This setting is used when user preferences are not available.'=>'選擇 AI 產生的搜尋回應的預設語言。此設定會在使用者偏好設定無法使用時使用。','Select the language for AI chatbot responses.'=>'選擇 AI 聊天機答覆的語言。','Select the language for AI-generated bot replies and reply suggestions.'=>'為 AI 產生的機器人回覆和回覆建議選擇語言。','Select the language for AI-generated topic suggestions and insights.'=>'為 AI 產生的主題建議和洞察力選擇語言。','Select the language for AI-generated topic summaries.'=>'為 AI 產生的主題摘要選擇語言。','Select the reCAPTCHA version. v2 Checkbox shows a visible checkbox, v2 Invisible runs in background but may show challenges, v3 is fully invisible and returns a score (0.0-1.0) without user interaction. Note: You must create separate API keys for each version in the Google reCAPTCHA admin panel.'=>'選擇 reCAPTCHA 版本。v2 Checkbox 顯示可見的核取方塊，v2 Invisible 在背景執行，但可能會顯示挑戰，v3 是完全不見的，並返回分數 (0.0-1.0)，無需使用者互動。注意：您必須在 Google reCAPTCHA 管理面板中為每個版本建立獨立的 API 金鑰。','Select the WordPress user account that will be used for bot-generated replies. Create a dedicated user account for the bot.'=>'選擇將用於機器人產生回覆的 WordPress 使用者帳號。為機器人建立專用的使用者帳號。','Select usergroups if you want to send private messages simultaneously to all users of that usergroups.'=>'如果要同時傳送私人訊息給該使用者群組的所有使用者，請選取使用者群組。','Select what elements the AI may include in bot replies.'=>'選擇 AI 可以在機器人回覆中包含哪些元素。','Select which activity types to display on the What\'s New page.'=>'選擇要在 What\'s New 頁面上顯示的活動類型。','Select which usergroups can use the AI Chatbot. New usergroups must be manually added here after creation.'=>'選擇哪些使用者群組可以使用 AI 聊天機。新使用者群組必須在建立後手動新增至此。','Self following not allowed!'=>'不允許自我跟蹤！','Semantic Search'=>'語意搜尋','Semantic Search AI Quality'=>'語意搜尋 AI 品質','Send'=>'發送','Send Email to Admins After User Self Delete'=>'使用者自行刪除後，傳送電子郵件給管理員','Send Notification emails to all email addresses (comma separated ) of forum administrators when a new Reply is created.'=>'當有新回復時，將通知電子郵件發送給論壇管理員的所有電子郵件地址（以逗號分隔）。','Send Notification emails to all email addresses (comma separated ) of forum administrators when a new Topic is created.'=>'當有新話題時，將通知電子郵件發送給論壇管理員的所有電子郵件地址（逗號分隔）。','Send Report'=>'發送報告','Sentiment analysis of your most active community members (excluding admins/moderators).'=>'您最活躍社群成員 (不包括管理員/版主) 的情緒分析。','Sentiment Over Time'=>'隨時間變化的情緒','Sentiment Trend Over Time'=>'隨著時間的推移，情緒趨勢','Separate tags using a comma'=>'使用逗號分隔標籤','Serbian'=>'塞爾維亞語','Serious - Focused and earnest'=>'認真 - 專注、認真','Server'=>'服務器','Server "post_max_size" is '=>'服務器"post_max_size" 是','Server "upload_max_filesize" is '=>'服務器"upload_max_filesize" 是','Server Information'=>'服務器信息','Service disconnected and all data has been permanently removed from gVectors AI servers.'=>'服務中斷且所有資料已從 gVectors AI 伺服器永久移除。','Service disconnected successfully. Your credits are preserved and will be restored when you reconnect. Your indexed content will be deleted after 30 days. You can reconnect anytime with the same site URL.'=>'服務成功中斷。您的點數將被保留，並將在您重新連線時恢復。您的索引內容將在 30 天後刪除。您可以隨時使用相同的網站 URL 重新連線。','Set 0 to check all replies, or limit to last N days.'=>'設定為 0 可檢查所有回覆，或限制為最近 N 天的回覆。','Set 0 to disable autorefresh'=>'設定 0 可停用自動刷新','set 0 to remove this limit'=>'設置0以刪除此限制','Set as Default'=>'設為默認','Set Bot Replies as Unapproved'=>'將 Bot 回覆設定為未核准','Set it unapproved'=>'設定為未核准','Set it unapproved and ban the author'=>'設定為未核准並封鎖作者','Set this option value 0 if you want to show all posts in recent posts area.'=>'如果要顯示最近發布區域中的所有帖子，請將此選項值設置為0。','Set this option value 0 if you want to show all posts under topic intro area.'=>'如果你像讓該話題下的全部帖子都顯示在它下面，把該項的值設為 0 即可。','Set this option value 0 if you want to show the whole title in recent topic area.'=>'如果要在最近的主題區域中顯示整個標題，請將此選項值設置為0。','Set this option value 0 to remove this limit.'=>'設定此選項的值為 0，即可移除此限制。','Set this option value 0 to remove time limit.'=>'如果要刪除時間限制，請將此選項值設置為0。','Set to 0 to disable access for that user type. Moderators (users with "ms" permission) are always unlimited. Limits reset daily at midnight.'=>'設定為 0 則停用該使用者類型的存取權限。版主（擁有「ms」權限的使用者）永遠都是無限制的。限制每天午夜重設。','Set to 0 to disable. Recommended: 20-30 posts per hour.'=>'設定為 0 則停用。建議：每小時 20-30 篇文章。','Set to 0 to disable. Recommended: 20-30 posts per IP per hour.'=>'設定為 0 則停用。建議：每 IP 每小時發佈 20-30 篇文章。','Set to 0 to disable. Recommended: 3-5 posts per minute.'=>'設定為 0 則停用。建議：每分鐘 3-5 篇文章。','Set to Paused to configure before activating'=>'設定為已暫停，以便在啟動前進行設定','Set Topic Sticky'=>'設置話題置頂','Setting saved'=>'設定已儲存','Settings'=>'設置','Settings &gt; Spam Protection Tab'=>'設定 &gt; 垃圾郵件防護標籤','Settings reset successfully'=>'設置重置成功','Settings successfully updated'=>'設置已更新','Share'=>'分享','Share Button Locations'=>'共享按鈕位置','Share Buttons'=>'分享按鈕','Share this post'=>'分享這個帖子','Share to Facebook'=>'分享至Facebook','Share to Google+'=>'分享到Google+','Share to LinkedIn'=>'分享至 LinkedIn','Share to OK'=>'分享到OK','Share to VK'=>'分享給VK','Share to WhatsApp'=>'分享至 WhatsApp','Share Urls'=>'分享URL','Share:'=>'分享：','Shop Account'=>'商店賬戶','Short'=>'短','Short Badge'=>'短徽章','Short Summary + Details'=>'簡短摘要 + 詳細