n Forum Layout'=>'置頂主題第一篇文章在某些論壇版面最上面','sticky'=>'置頂','Sticky Topics'=>'置頂話題','Stop guessing what your community wants. AI Analytics reveals hidden patterns in member behavior. Comprehensive AI-driven analytics for smarter community management. Monitor real-time engagement metrics, track topic performance, identify trending discussions, discover underserved content areas, and receive personalized growth recommendations. Advanced sentiment analysis, member retention insights, and predictive trends help you stay ahead.'=>'停止猜測您的社群想要什麼。AI 分析揭示會員行為中隱藏的模式。全面的 AI 驅動分析，讓社群管理更聰明。監控即時參與指標、追蹤主題表現、識別趨勢討論、發現服務不足的內容領域，並接收個人化的成長建議。先進的情感分析、會員保留洞察力和預測趨勢可協助您保持領先。','Stop Indexing'=>'停止索引','Stop Sending Emails to Admins on New User Registration'=>'停止在新使用者註冊時傳送電子郵件給管理員','Stop when credits fall below this'=>'點數低於此值時停止','storage'=>'儲存','Storage Mode'=>'儲存模式','Storage Settings'=>'儲存設定','Store AI-generated vector embeddings locally on your WordPress server. Perfect for smaller forums or sites with storage capacity. Vectors are stored in your database, giving you full control over your data while enabling semantic search and AI features without external dependencies.'=>'在您的 WordPress 伺服器本機儲存 AI 產生的向量嵌入。非常適合儲存容量較小的論壇或網站。向量會儲存在您的資料庫中，讓您可以完全控制資料，同時無需外部依賴即可啟用語意搜尋與 AI 功能。','Strength:'=>'強度：','Structured with Sections'=>'分段式結構','Styles'=>'風格','Subforums'=>'子論壇','Submit'=>'提交','Submit &amp; Deactivate'=>'提交&amp; 停用','Subscribe confirmation email message'=>'訂閱確認郵件的內容','Subscribe confirmation email subject'=>'確認郵件訂閱的標題','Subscribe for new posts'=>'訂閱新文章','Subscribe for new replies'=>'訂閱新的回覆','Subscribe for new topics'=>'訂閱新的話題','Subscribe options successfully updated'=>'已成功更新訂閱選項','Subscribe options successfully updated, but previous value not changed'=>'已成功更新訂閱選項，但前一個值沒有更改','Subscribe to all new topics'=>'訂閱所有新主題','Subscribe to all new topics and posts'=>'訂閱所有新主題和帖子','Subscribe to this question'=>'訂閱此問題','Subscribe to this topic'=>'訂閱此話題','Subscribed forum or topic title'=>'已訂閱的論壇或主題標題','Subscriber