Tags are disabled'=>'標籤被禁用','Tags are suggested while you type in the tag field. Using this option you can limit the maximum number of suggested tags.'=>'標籤會在您輸入標籤欄位時提出。使用此選項，您可以限制建議標籤的最大數量。','Target Forums'=>'目標論壇','Target Settings'=>'目標設定','Target Topic IDs'=>'目標主題 ID','Target Topic not found'=>'目標主題未找到','Target Topic URL'=>'目標主題網址','Task Execution'=>'任務執行','Task Name'=>'任務名稱','Task Type'=>'任務類型','Task will only run on selected days'=>'任務只會在選定的日子執行','Tasks consume AI credits. Monitor usage carefully to avoid unexpected costs.'=>'任務會消耗 AI 點數。請小心監控使用量，以避免意外支出。','Taxonomy'=>'分類學','TB'=>'TB','Technical - Detailed and precise'=>'技術 - 詳細且精確','Telegram'=>'電報','Temporarily ban user'=>'暫時封鎖使用者','Temporarily Inactive'=>'暫時閒置','Temporary ban duration'=>'臨時禁令期限','Tenant ID:'=>'租戶 ID：','Terms'=>'條款','Terms of Service'=>'服務條款','Terms/Categories'=>'術語/類別','Test Search'=>'測試搜尋','Test Semantic Search'=>'測試語意搜尋','Test the AI semantic search with your indexed topics. Results include metadata for generating topic and post URLs.'=>'使用您索引的主題測試 AI 語意搜尋。結果包括產生主題和文章 URL 的元資料。','Text Editor'=>'文本編輯器','Thai'=>'泰語','Thank you for using wpForo! wpForo is a professional bulletin board for WordPress, and the only forum software which comes with Multi-layout template system. The "Extended'=>'感謝您使用wpforo！wpforo是一個專業的WordPress 論壇插件, 也是唯一一個帶有多布局模板的論壇插件。','Thank you for using wpForo! wpForo is the first 360° AI-powered forum platform for WordPress with revolutionary AI features and Multi-layout template system.
                                    The "Extended", "Simplified", "Q&A", "Threaded" and "Boxed" layouts fit almost all type of discussions needs. You can use wpForo for small and extremely large communities. If you found some issue or bug please open a support topic in wpForo Support forum at wpForo.com. If you liked wpForo please leave some good review for this plugin.'=>'感謝您使用 wpForo！wpForo 是 WordPress 的第一個 360° AI 驅動的論壇平台，具有革命性的 AI 功能和多佈局模板系統。
                                    擴展"、「簡化」、"Q&A"、"Threaded 「和 」Boxed "版面幾乎可以滿足所有類型的討論需求。您可以將 wpForo 用於小型或超大型的社群。如果您發現一些問題或錯誤，請在 wpForo.com 的 wpForo 支援論壇開啟支援主題。如果您喜歡 wpForo，請為此外掛留下好評。','Thank you for using wpForo. wpForo is a premium forum plugin which will always be available for free. There will never be paid and pro versions of this forum board. However this is a very large and hard project so we also develop paid addons (extensions), which will financially help us to keep improving and adding new features to the free wpForo plugin. Forum addons will also be actively developed. The first addons "Advanced Media Uploader'=>'感謝您使用wpforo! wpforo是優質的論壇插件，它將永遠免費，永遠不會有付費版本。然而這是一個非常大而艱巨的任務，所以我們還開發了付費的擴展插件，這將幫助我們在經濟上不斷完善和增加新的功能插件，論壇插件也將積極發展。第一個插件“先進的媒體上傳”、“民意測驗”、“私人信息”和“廣告經理”將可很快上線。一旦你有了一些插件和激活，你會發現在這裡設置垂直標籤。','Thank you for your feedback!'=>'感謝您的反饋意見！','Thank you!<br> Sincerely yours,<br> gVectors Team'=>'謝謝！<br> 真誠的你，<br> gVectors團隊','The "slug" is the URL-friendly version of the board name. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers, and hyphens.'=>'slug" 是討論版名稱的 URL 友善版本。它通常全小楷，只包含字母、數字和連字符。','The "slug" is the URL-friendly version of the name. It is usually all lowercase and contains only letters, numbers, and hyphens.'=>'“slug” 是用在 URL 中的名稱，它應總是小寫的，可含有字幕，數字和連字符。','The [Synchronize] button changes all users Usergroups according to the users Roles. For example, if you select "Contributor" Role for "Registered" Usergroup, all users with "Contributor" Role will get "Registered" Usergroup in forum. The synchronization process may take a few seconds or dozens of minutes, it depends on the number of users. Please be patient, don\'t close this page and wait until the progress counter says 100% completed.'=>'[同步]按鈕根據用戶角色更改所有用戶用戶組。例如，如果為“已註冊”用戶組選擇“貢獻者”角色，則具有“貢獻者”角色的所有用戶將在論壇中獲得“已註冊”用戶組。同步過程可能需要幾秒鐘或幾十分鐘，這取決於用戶數量。請耐心等待，不要關閉此頁面，等待進度計數器顯示100％完成。','The analysis considers the last 100-500 posts depending on forum activity level.'=>'分析考慮最近 100-500 個文章，視論壇活動程度而定。','The color of almost all links'=>'幾乎所有連結的顏色','The default Guest usergroup is not found!'=>'找不到默認的Guest用戶組！','The Default Profile Cover Image'=>'預設個人資料封面圖片','The fifth forum layout with a modern boxed card design. All five layouts have been refreshed with a clean, contemporary look.'=>'第五個論壇版面，採用現代的盒式卡片設計。所有五個版面都以簡潔的現代風格煥然一新。','The following topics are automatically excluded from AI indexing:'=>'下列主題會自動排除在 AI 索引之外：','The General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) (Regulation (EU) 2016/679) is a regulation by which the European Parliament, the Council of the European Union and the European Commission intend to strengthen and unify data protection for all individuals within the European Union (EU). After four years of preparation and debate the GDPR was finally approved by the EU Parliament on 14 April 2016. Enforcement date: 25 May 2018 - at which time those organizations in non-compliance may face heavy fines. More info at'=>'“一般數據保護條例”（GDPR）（法規（EU）2016/679）是歐洲議會，歐盟理事會和歐盟委員會旨在加強和統一歐盟內所有個人數據保護的法規（歐洲聯盟）。經過四年的準備和辯論，GDPR最終於2016年4月14日獲得歐盟議會批准。執行日期：2018年5月25日 - 屆時這些違規組織可能面臨巨額罰款。更多信息在','The general share buttons can be displayed on both (top and bottom) locations.'=>'一般分享按鈕可顯示在兩個（頂部和底部）位置。','The key is expired'=>'密鑰已過期','The key is invalid'=>'密鑰無效','the layout you want'=>'您想要的版面','The light gray background of almost all sections and boxes (header, menu, topic overview, footer, etc...)'=>'幾乎所有區段和方塊（標頭、功能表、主題總覽、頁尾等...）的淺灰色背景','The lightest gray background of sections and boxes (forum list, members boxes, reply background, etc...)'=>'區段和方塊（論壇列表、會員方塊、回覆背景等...）的最淺灰色背景','The minimum number of replies a topic must have before the Summarize Topic button is displayed. Set to 0 to always show the button, or 1 to require at least one reply.'=>'顯示總結主題按鈕前，主題必須至少有一個回覆。設定為 0 則永遠顯示按鈕，設定為 1 則至少需要一個回覆。','The minimum number of words in the topic title required to trigger AI suggestions.'=>'觸發 AI 建議所需的主題標題字數下限。','The names of selected secondary usergroups will be displayed under the corresponding usergroup\'s users avatar in forum posts.'=>'選取的次要使用者群組的名稱將會顯示在論壇文章中相對應的使用者群組的使用者頭像之下。','The names of selected usergroups will be displayed under the corresponding usergroup\'s users avatar in forum posts.'=>'選取的使用者群組名稱會顯示在論壇文章中相對應的使用者群組頭像下。','The new forum page will be created automatically with the next autoincrement page ID, you do not need to modify it when you create a new forum board. Only change this ID if you have already created a new page for this forum board.'=>'新的版面將自動以下一個自動增加的頁面ID建立，您不需要在建立新的討論版時修改它。只有當您已經為這個討論區建立了新的頁面時，才需要修改這個 ID。','The noIndex code tells Google and other search engines to NOT index the page, so that it cannot be found in search results. Please insert page URLs you do not want to be indexed one per line in the textarea bellow.'=>'noIndex代碼告訴Google和其他搜索引擎不對頁面編制索引，因此無法在搜索結果中找到它。請在textarea下面插入您不希望每行編入索引的頁面URL。','The note text and the label of this checkbox can be managed in Forums > Phrases admin page. Search the label phrase, click on edit button and change it.'=>'注釋文本和此複選框的標籤可以在論壇>短語管理頁面中進行管理。 搜索標籤短語，單擊編輯按鈕並進行更改。','The number of forum members with this usergroup. Click to view members.'=>'具有此用戶組的論壇成員數。點擊查看會員。','The password has been changed'=>'關聯','The password reset empty'=>'密碼重置為空','The password reset mismatch'=>'密碼重置不匹配','The plugin is great, but I need specific features'=>'該插件很棒，但我需要特定的功能','The plugin is not working'=>'該插件無法正常工作','The plugin works very slow'=>'該插件工作非常慢','The position in the menu order wpForo should appear.'=>'wpForo 該出現在後台左側菜單的哪個位置。','The post edit logging information \'This post was modified 2 hours ago by John\' is displayed under modified post content...'=>'帖子編輯日誌信息“此帖由John於2小時前修改過”顯示在修改後的帖子內容下。','The post sharing toggle can be displayed either on the left side or on the top of each post.'=>'文章分享切換鍵可以顯示在每篇文章的左側或頂端。','The post sharing toggle can be displayed either on the left side or on the top of each post. The general share buttons can be displayed on both (top and bottom) locations.'=>'帖子共享切換可以顯示在每個帖子的左側或頂部。 一般共享按鈕可以顯示在兩個（頂部和底部）位置。','The queue updates automatically every 30 seconds while indexing is in progress.'=>'索引進行時，佇列每 30 秒自動更新一次。','The search icon in the forum menu will be hidden on the home page if the &quot;Open [AI Assistant] widget by Default on Home Page&quot; option is enabled in AI Features setting page.'=>'如果在 AI 功能設定頁啟用 &quot;Open [AI Assistant] widget by Default on Home Page&quot; 選項，版面選單中的搜尋圖示將會在首頁隱藏。','The selected Usergroup cannot be set'=>'無法設置所選的用戶組','The selected Usergroup is not found in allowed list'=>'在允許列表中找不到所選的用戶組','The setTimestamp() method of PHP DateTime class is not available. Please make sure you use PHP 5.4 and higher version on your hosting service.'=>'PHP DateTime類的setTimestamp() 方法不可用。請確保您在託管服務上使用PHP 5.4及更高版本。','The time to delete this post is expired.'=>'刪除此帖子的時間已過期。','The time to delete this topic is expired.'=>'刪除此主題的時間已過期。','The time to edit this post is expired.'=>'編輯此帖子的時間已過期。','The time to edit this topic is expired'=>'編輯此主題的時間已過期','The topic edit logging information \'This post was modified 2 hours ago by John\' is displayed under modified topic first post content...'=>'帖子編輯日誌信息“此帖由John於2小時前修改過”顯示在修改後的主題第一帖子內容下。','The uploaded file exceeds the MAX_FILE_SIZE directive that was specified in the HTML form'=>'在指定的HTML表單中，上傳的文件超過PHP 中 MAX_FILE_SIZE 的設定值','The uploaded file exceeds the upload_max_filesize directive in php.ini'=>'上傳的文件在php.ini中超過upload_max_filesize指令','The uploaded file size is too big'=>'上傳的文件太大','The uploaded file was only partially uploaded'=>'僅上傳了文件的一部分','the website'=>'網站','Theme delete error'=>'主題刪除錯誤','Theme delete success'=>'主題刪除成功','Theme file not readable'=>'主題文件不可讀','Theme for reCAPTCHA v2 widget. Not applicable to v3.'=>'reCAPTCHA v2 widget 的主題。不適用於 v3。','Theme options reset successfully'=>'主題選項重置成功','Theme options successfully updated'=>'主題選項已更新','Theme Successfully Activated'=>'主題已成功啟動','Themes'=>'主題','These options allow you to change the font sizes of forum and topic titles as well as the font size of post content.'=>'這些選項可讓您變更版面和主題標題的字型大小，以及文章內容的字型大小。','These settings will be used for all future indexing operations.'=>'這些設定將用於未來所有的索引作業。','This access is usually used for '=>'該訪問權限通常用於','This action changes topic URL. Once the topic is moved to other forum the old URL of this topic will no longer be available.'=>'此操作會更改主題URL。將主題移至其他論壇後，此主題的舊網址將不再可用。','This action is only for local storage mode.'=>'此動作只適用於本機儲存模式。','This action will also delete all sub-forums, topics and replies.'=>'此操作也將刪除所有子論壇、主題和答覆。','This action will disconnect your forum and immediately delete all indexed content, embeddings, and tenant data from the AI service. This cannot be undone. Your credits will NOT be preserved.'=>'此動作將中斷您的討論區，並立即從 AI 服務中刪除所有索引內容、內嵌和租戶資料。此動作無法取消。您的點數不會被保留。','This email address is already registered. Please insert another'=>'該郵箱地址已被註冊。請插入另一個','This email address is already registered. Please insert another.'=>'該電郵地址已被使用，請換一個。','This feature is not available.'=>'此功能無法使用。','This feature is useful if you\'re adding content before or after [wpforo] shortcode in page content. Also it useful if forum is loaded before website header, on top of the front-end.'=>'你可以在網頁內容之前或之後添加[wpforo]短代碼。如果論壇在網站的標題，頂部的前端加載短碼也是有用的。','This is a basic example of forum rules provided by'=>'這是由論壇提供的論壇規則的基本示例','This is a board specific general setting page. Boards are separate forums in separate pages. By default, there is a one forum board and one setting menu. If you create a second forum board, you\'ll have a separate set of menus per board. You can create a new board if you want to have more than one forum in your website. For example, you can use boards to create separate forums for different languages "EN Forum" and "FR Forum". Here, you can enable forum cache and manage some board specific permalinks.'=>'這是特定討論區的一般設定頁面。討論版是獨立頁面中的獨立版面。預設情況下，只有一個討論版和一個設定選單。如果您建立了第二個討論區，每個討論區就會有一組獨立的選單。如果您想在網站上有一個以上的討論區，您可以建立一個新的討論區。例如，您可以使用討論區為不同語言創建獨立的版面 「EN 論壇 」和 「FR 論壇」。在這裡，您可以啟用版面快取，並管理一些特定版面的永久連結。','This is a forum description. This content will be displayed under forum title on the forum list.'=>'這是一個論壇的描述。此內容將在論壇列表的論壇標題下顯示。','This is a section with some important buttons for quick actions and accesses to certain admin pages. it\'s located in the forum home page under the forum list. This section is only available for website administrators.'=>'這個區塊有一些重要的按鈕，用於快速操作和存取某些管理頁面。它位於論壇首頁的論壇列表下方。這個區塊只有網站管理員才能使用。','This is a simple category / section'=>'這是一個簡單的類別/部分','This is a simple parent forum'=>'這是一個簡單的家長論壇','This is an AI-generated suggestion based on existing forum content. Please verify the information.'=>'這是基於現有論壇內容的 AI 建議。請核實資訊。','This is an example of forum Privacy Policy with GDPR compliant. It adapted to wpForo plugin functions and features. <u>In case you enable this privacy policy template you become responsible for the content of this template.</u> Please read this text carefully and make sure it suits your community Privacy Policy. If it doesn\'t, you should edit this text and adapt it to your community rules. This template includes shortcodes [forum-name] and [forum-url]. They are automatically replaced on registration page with current forum details. Don\'t forget to add an information about your organization, location and contacting ways (page, email, phone, etc...). Also if you have a separate privacy policy page for website please add a link to that page.'=>'這是符合GDPR的論壇隱私政策的示例。它適用於wpForo插件的功能和特性。 <u>如果您啟用此隱私政策模板，則您需要對此模板的內容負責。</ u>請仔細閱讀本文並確保其適合您的社區隱私政策。如果沒有，您應該編輯此文本並使其適應您的社區規則。此模板包括短代碼[forum-name]和[forum-url]。它們會在註冊頁面上自動替換為當前論壇詳細信息。不要忘記添加有關您的組織，位置和聯繫方式的信息（頁面，電子郵件，電話等）。此外，如果您有一個單獨的網站隱私政策頁面，請添加指向該頁面的鏈接。','This is just the beginning. We\'re actively developing additional AI features including sentiment analysis, member retention predictions, personalized content feeds, and advanced automation tools. Join our growing community and help shape the future of forum AI.'=>'這只是個開始。我們正積極開發其他 AI 功能，包括情感分析、會員保留率預測、個人化內容饋送以及進階自動化工具。加入我們成長中的社群，協助塑造論壇 AI 的未來。','This is only used when a new Usergroup is created, it automatically gets the selected Forum Access in all forums.'=>'這僅在創建新用戶組時使用，它會自動在所有論壇中獲取所選的論壇訪問權限。','This is the members\' directory setting page. wpForo forum has a members\' page where you can see all members. The members\' page is called members directory, and it\'s general for all forum boards. Starting from wpForo 2.0 you can create multiple separate forum boards in your website, however the members\' directory will be one for all boards.'=>'wpForo 論壇有一個會員頁面，在這裡您可以看到所有的會員。會員頁面被稱為會員目錄，它是所有討論版的通用頁面。從 wpForo 2.0 開始，您可以在您的網站上建立多個獨立的討論版，但是所有討論版的會員目錄都是一個。','This is the number of comments under the answers before clicking the [load more comments] button. Set this option value 0 if you want to show all comments.'=>'這是按一下 [載入更多備註] 按鈕前答案下方的備註數量。如果您想顯示所有評論，請將此選項值設定為 0。','This is the right place to manage topics and posts displaying options. Here you can manage the number of topics and posts per page, also you can display or hide recent posts under each topic in certain forum layouts. Some options are grouped by forum layouts.'=>'這是管理主題和文章顯示選項的正確位置。在這裡您可以管理每頁的主題和文章數量，也可以在特定版面的每個主題下顯示或隱藏最近的文章。有些選項是依版面設計來分類的。','This is to notify you that a user has successfully deleted their account from the website. Below are the details: 

User ID: [user_userid]

Username: [user_login]

Email: [user_email]

Deletion Date and Time: [datetime] 
'=>'這是通知您有使用者已成功從網站上刪除其帳戶。以下是詳細資訊：

使用者 ID：[user_userid］

使用者名稱：[user_login］

電子郵件：[user_email]

刪除日期和時間: [datetime]
','This menu bar contains the forum menu, notification bell and forum search section.'=>'此選單列包含討論區選單、通知鈴聲和討論區搜尋區。','This message comes from post reporting pop-up form.'=>'此消息來自帖子報告彈窗。','This message comes from Reset Password form.'=>'此消息來自重置密碼表單。','This message comes when a user deletes self account from site'=>'當使用者從網站上刪除自己的帳號時，會出現此訊息','This message comes when moderators has been manually approved a user'=>'此訊息會在版主手動核准使用者時出現','This message comes when new user registers to site'=>'當新用戶註冊到站點時，會出現此消息','This method will also remove all user information and content.'=>'此方法也會移除所有使用者資訊和內容。','This method will delete only profile information so all content which created this user will be kept and renamed as Anonymous.'=>'此方法只會刪除個人檔案資訊，因此所有建立此使用者的內容都會保留，並重新命名為 Anonymous。','This nickname is already in use. Please insert another.'=>'這個暱稱已經在使用中。請插入另一個。','This nickname is already registered. Please insert another.'=>'這個暱稱已經註冊。請插入另一個。','This notification is only visible for the website administrators. It will be automatically disabled once some antispam solution is enabled. If you don\'t use wpForo registration form or you\'re sure, that you have an antispam solution just click the [dismiss] button.'=>'此通知僅對網站管理員可見。一旦某些反垃圾郵件解決方案被啟用，它將被自動禁用。如果您不使用 wpForo 註冊表單或您確定您有防垃圾郵件解決方案，只要按一下 [解除] 按鈕即可。','This option adds topic subscription checkbox next to new topic and post submit button.'=>'此選項在新話題旁邊添加話題訂閱複選框和發布提交按鈕。','This option allows managing topic and post URL structure. By default, URLs are built based on topic titles. You can change them to ID and make them shorter.'=>'此選項允許管理主題和文章的 URL 結構。預設情況下，URL 會根據主題標題建立。您可以將其變更為 ID 並使其更短。','This option allows you to manage the sidebar location in wpForo.'=>'此選項可讓您管理 wpForo 中的側邊欄位置。','This option displays a contact form under the \'Awaiting approval\' text to allow inactive users send a message to website administrator. This message will be sent to the administrator email address.'=>'此選項在 「等待批准 」文字下顯示聯絡表單，讓非活動使用者傳送訊息給網站管理員。此訊息會傳送到管理員的電子郵件信箱。','This option displays the top black bar for accessing to the dashboard. Make sure the regular members can only access to their own profile editing page before enabling this option.'=>'此選項顯示用於存取儀表板的頂部黑條。啟用此選項前，請確定一般會員只能存取自己的個人資料編輯頁面。','This option doesn\'t affect website admins.'=>'此選項不影響網站管理員。','This option has disabled because you have more than 50 users in this group.'=>'此選項已停用，因為該群組中有超過 50 位使用者。','This option is not synced with WordPress "Anyone can register" option in Dashboard > Settings > General admin page. If this option is enabled new users will always be able to register.'=>'此選項不同步WordPress的“任何人都可以登記”選項>設置>常規儀錶盤管理頁面。如果這個選項被啟用，新的用戶將永遠能夠註冊。','This option is not synced with WordPress \'Anyone can register\' option in Dashboard > Settings > General admin page. If this option is enabled new users will always be able to register.'=>'此選項與儀表板 > 設定 > 一般管理頁面中的 WordPress「任何人都可以註冊」選項不同步。如果啟用此選項，新使用者永遠都可以註冊。','This option is only related to XML language files. You should upload a translation XML file to have a new language option in this drop-down. If you are using PO/MO translation files you should change WordPress Language in Dashboard > Settings admin page to load according translation for wpForo.'=>'此選項僅與XML語言文件相關。 您應該在此下拉列表中上傳翻譯XML文件以使用新的語言選項。 如果您使用PO / MO翻譯文件，則應在“儀錶盤>設置”管理頁面中更改WordPress語言，以便根據wpForo的翻譯加載。','This option keeps the first topic post on top when you navigate through pages of that topic. You can manage this option by forum layouts.'=>'當您瀏覽該主題的頁面時，此選項會將第一個主題帖保持在最前面。 您可以通過論壇布局管理此選項。','This option will disable WordPress on front-end. Only forum pages and excluded post/pages will be available. wpForo will look like as a stand-alone forum.'=>'此選項將在前端禁用WordPress。 只有論壇頁面和排除的帖子/頁面將可用。 wpForo將看起來像一個獨立的論壇。','This option will disable WordPress on front-end. Only forum pages will be available. wpForo will look like as a stand-alone forum.'=>'此選項將禁用WordPress的主頁。只有論壇頁面將可用。網站看起來會像是一個獨立的論壇。','This post is currently unapproved. You can approve posts in Dashboard &raquo; Forums &raquo; Moderation admin page.'=>'此帖未通過審核，你可在“後台&raquo; 論壇&raquo; 管理”中批准。','This post successfully deleted'=>'該帖已成功刪除','This post successfully edited'=>'該帖已更新成功','This post was modified %s by %s'=>'這篇文章被%s 修改了%s','This process may take a few seconds or dozens of minutes, it depends on database forum size and on server resources. Please be patient and don\'t close this page. If you got 500 Server Error please don\'t worry, the data updating process is still working in MySQL server.'=>'這個過程可能需要幾秒鐘或幾十分鐘，它取決於數據庫論壇的大小和服務器資源。請耐心等待，不要關閉此頁。如果出現500服務器錯誤，請不要擔心，數據更新過程MySQL服務器仍然在工作。','This process may take a few seconds or dozens of minutes, please be patient and don\'t close this page.'=>'此過程需要幾秒乃至數十分鐘，請耐心等待，不要關閉頁面。','This process may take a few seconds or dozens of minutes, please be patient and don\'t close this page. If you got 500 Server Error please don\'t worry, the data updating process is still working in MySQL server.'=>'這個過程可能需要幾秒鐘或幾十分鐘，請耐心等待，不要關閉此頁。如果顯示“500服務器錯誤”，請不要擔心，數據更新的過程MySQL服務器任然在工作。','This should be set a negative value like \'-1\' to decrease the user reputation points if he/she receives dislikes.'=>'這應該設為負值，例如 \'-1\'，以便在使用者收到不喜歡時減少他/她的聲望分數。','This tool is designed to find attachment which have been uploaded by spammers. The tool checks most common spammer filenames and suggest to delete but you should check one by one and make sure those are spam files before deleting.'=>'此工具用來查找垃圾附件，通過查找最常用的垃圾文件名並建議刪除。不過你應該逐一檢查這些文件，在刪除之前應確認是垃圾附件。','This topic doesn\'t exist or you don\'t have permissions to see that.'=>'此主題不存在，或者您無權查看該主題。','This topic is currently unapproved. You can approve topics in Dashboard &raquo; Forums &raquo; Moderation admin page.'=>'此話題未通過審核，你可在“後台&raquo; 論壇&raquo; 管理”中批准。','This topic successfully deleted'=>'此話題已成功刪除','This topic was modified %s by %s'=>'此主題已由%s 修改%s','This topic will be private'=>'此主題將為私人主題','This user Usergroup is automatically changed according to current Role. If you want to disable Role-Usergroup synchronization and manage Usergroups and User Roles independently, please navigate to <b>Dashboard > wpForo > Settings > Login & Registration</b> admin page and disable "Role-Usergroup Synchronization" option.'=>'此使用者使用者群組會根據目前的角色自動改變。如果您想要停用角色-使用者群組同步化，並獨立管理使用者群組與使用者角色，請瀏覽 <b>Dashboard > wpForo > Settings > Login & Registration</b> 管理頁面，並停用 "Role-Usergroup Synchronization" 選項。','This will index all forum topics. Continue?'=>'這將索引所有論壇主題。繼續？','This will permanently delete all indexed content from the selected forums. Topics will need to be re-indexed to appear in AI search results. Continue?'=>'這將會永久刪除所選論壇的所有索引內容。主題將需要重新索引才能出現在 AI 搜尋結果中。繼續嗎？','This will queue up to 10,000 not-yet-indexed topics from the selected forums for background indexing. Private and unapproved topics are automatically excluded. Continue?'=>'這將從所選的版面中排出多達 10,000 個尚未索引的主題進行背景索引。隱私和未核准的主題會自動排除在外。繼續嗎？','This will re-index all topics that contain images. Topics without images will not be affected. Continue?'=>'這將會重新索引所有包含圖片的主題。沒有圖片的主題將不受影響。繼續嗎？','This will re-index all topics. Continue?'=>'這將會重新索引所有主題。繼續嗎？','This will remove all WordPress content from the AI index. Continue?'=>'這將會從 AI 索引中移除所有 WordPress 內容。繼續嗎？','This will stop all pending indexing jobs. Continue?'=>'這將會停止所有待執行的索引工作。繼續嗎？','This will use %d credit(s) from your balance.'=>'這將使用您餘額中的 %d 點數。','This Year'=>'今年','Thoughtful - Considerate and reflective'=>'深思熟慮 - 考慮周全、善於反思','Threaded Forum Layout'=>'主題版面設計','Threaded Layout - Display Add Topic Button on Forum List'=>'線程布局 - 在論壇列表上顯示添加主題按鈕','Threaded Layout - Display Sub Forums with Parent Forums'=>'主題版面 - 顯示子討論區與父討論區','Threaded Layout - Display Thread Filtering Buttons'=>'線程布局 - 顯示線程過濾按鈕','Threaded Layout - First Post Reply Button'=>'線程布局 - 第一個帖子回覆按鈕','Threaded Layout - Forums List'=>'線程布局 - 論壇列表','Threaded Layout - Number of Parent Posts per Page'=>'線程布局 - 每頁父帖子數','Threaded Layout - Number of Recent topics'=>'線程布局 - 最近主題的數量','Threaded Layout - Recent topic length'=>'線程布局 - 最近的主題長度','Threaded Layout - Replies Nesting Levels Deep'=>'線程布局 - 深度回復嵌套級別','Threaded Layout - Reply Form Type'=>'線程布局 - 回復表單類型','Threads'=>'主題','Threads rebuilt successfully'=>'線程重建成功','Thu'=>'星期四','Time Range:'=>'時間範圍：','Timezone'=>'時區','Tips & Tricks - Quick helpful hints'=>'秘訣與技巧 - 快速有用的提示','Title'=>'標題','title'=>'名稱','Title for Guests'=>'訪客標題','Title for Users'=>'使用者標題','To'=>'至','to'=>'至','To continue using AI features, please upgrade to a paid plan.'=>'若要繼續使用 AI 功能，請升級至付費方案。','to reply to this topic.'=>'來回覆此主題。','To start using reCAPTCHA, you need to sign up for an API key pair for your site. Important: API keys are version-specific - you must create keys matching the version selected above. '=>'要開始使用 reCAPTCHA，您需要為您的網站註冊一對 API 金鑰。重要事項：API 金鑰是特定版本的 - 您必須建立符合上述所選版本的金鑰。','To:'=>'致：','Today'=>'今天','Tokens Used'=>'使用的代幣','Too many posts from your location. Please wait before trying again.'=>'來自您所在位置的文章太多。請稍候再試。','Toolbar Location of the Reply Editor'=>'回覆編輯器的工具列位置','Toolbar Location of the Topic Editor'=>'主題編輯器的工具列位置','Tools'=>'工具','Tools: Move, Split, Merge'=>'工具：移動，拆分，合併','Top'=>'回頂端','Top Contributor'=>'最高貢獻者','Top Contributors'=>'最高貢獻者','Top Contributors Mood'=>'頂級貢獻者心情','Top Forums by Activity'=>'按活動排列的頂尖論壇','Top Repliers:'=>'最頂尖的代表：','Top right pop-up message background color'=>'右上方快顯訊息背景顏色','TOPIC'=>'主題','Topic'=>'話題','Topic #%d has been queued for indexing. Check the status box for progress. %s'=>'主題 #%d 已經排隊進行索引。檢查狀態方塊以瞭解進度。%s','Topic #%d is already up to date. All %d posts are unchanged, no reindexing needed. (0 credits used)'=>'主題 #%d 已經是最新的。所有 %d 的文章都沒變，不需要重新索引。(使用 0 點數)','Topic #%d update queued. %d posts to re-index (%d changed, %d new). %s'=>'主題 #%d 更新已排隊。%d篇文章要重新索引 (%d 已變更，%d 新增)。%s','Topic (post list)'=>'主題（帖子列表）','Topic add error'=>'話題添加錯誤','Topic and Post Moderation'=>'話題和帖子管理','Topic and post moderation buttons\' color (reply, quote, like, sticky, closed, move, delete, etc...)'=>'主題和文章管理按鈕的顏色 (回覆、引用、讚、黏貼、關閉、移動、刪除等...)','Topic are private, please register or login for further information'=>'主題是私有的，請註冊或登錄以獲取更多信息','Topic Author'=>'主題作者','Topic Author User IDs'=>'主題作者使用者 ID','Topic Content Maximum Length'=>'主題內容最大長度','Topic Content Minimum Length'=>'主題內容 最小長度','Topic Counts'=>'主題計數','Topic Date Range Filter'=>'主題日期範圍篩選器','Topic delete error'=>'話題刪除錯誤','Topic edit error'=>'話題編輯錯誤','Topic first post data not found.'=>'未找到話題首貼的數據','Topic first post not found.'=>'未找到話題首貼','Topic Generator'=>'主題產生器','Topic Icons'=>'話題圖標','Topic IDs = always included (any status)'=>'主題 ID = 永遠包含 (任何狀態)','Topic link'=>'主題鏈接','Topic Links - Jump to First Unread Post'=>'主題連結 - 跳至第一篇未讀文章','Topic list head panel background color'=>'主題清單頭部面板背景顏色','Topic Move Error'=>'話題移動錯誤','Topic Navigation'=>'主題導覽','topic not found'=>'主題未找到','Topic not found.'=>'沒找到話題','Topic once split cannot be unsplit. The first post of new topic becomes the earliest reply.'=>'主題一旦拆分不能解開。新主題的第一篇文章成為最早的回覆。','Topic Overview'=>'主題概述','Topic overview and more...'=>'主題概述及更多...','Topic Prefix'=>'主題前綴','Topic reply'=>'主題回復','Topic RSS Feed'=>'話題 RSS Feed','Topic splitting error'=>'主題分割錯誤','Topic starter'=>'主題啟動器','Topic Status'=>'主題狀態','Topic Style'=>'主題風格','Topic subscription option on post editor'=>'文章編輯器上的話題訂閱選項','Topic subscription option on post editor - checked/enabled'=>'帖子編輯器上的話題訂閱選項 - 已選中/已啟用','Topic successfully moved'=>'話題移動成功','Topic successfully updated'=>'話題更新成功','Topic Suggestions'=>'主題建議','Topic Suggestions AI Quality'=>'主題建議 AI 品質','Topic Summary'=>'主題摘要','Topic Summary AI Quality'=>'主題摘要 AI 品質','Topic Summary Style'=>'主題摘要風格','Topic Tag'=>'主題標籤','Topic Tag Moderation'=>'主題標籤管理','Topic Tag:'=>'主題標籤：','Topic Tags'=>'主題標籤','Topic Theme/Focus'=>'主題主題/焦點','Topic Title'=>'話題的標題','Topic title'=>'話題的標題','Topic title / link'=>'主題標題 / 連結','Topic title length cannot be set more than 250 character.'=>'主題標題的長度不能超過 250 個字元。','Topic Title Maximum Length'=>'主題標題 最大長度','Topic Title Minimum Length'=>'主題標題 最小長度','Topic Tone'=>'主題音','Topic/post action link hover color (reply, quote, like, sticky, closed, move, delete)'=>'主題/貼文動作連結的懸浮顏色 (回覆、引用、讚、黏貼、關閉、移動、刪除)','Topics'=>'話題','topics'=>'主題','Topics &amp; Posts'=>'話題 &amp; 帖子','topics and posts'=>'主題和帖子','Topics delete error'=>'話題刪除錯誤','Topics font size:'=>'主題字型大小：','Topics from selected forums (excludes private, closed, unapproved)'=>'選定論壇的主題（不包括私人、封閉、未核准的主題）','Topics once merged cannot be unmerged. This topic URL will no longer be available.'=>'合併後的主題無法取消合併。此主題網址將不再可用。','Topics Per Batch'=>'每批主題','Topics per batch must be between 1 and 50.'=>'每批主題必須介於 1 到 50 個之間。','Topics Per Run'=>'每次運行的主題','Topics RSS Feed'=>'主題RSS Feed','Topics Started'=>'主題已開始','topics with images'=>'有圖片的主題','Topics with their latest replies in reversed order'=>'主題與最新回覆的順序相反','Total Credits Used'=>'已使用的總信用額','Total Indexed'=>'指數總額','Total Indexed:'=>'總索引：','Total Posts'=>'總職位','Total Runs'=>'總跑數','Total Size'=>'總的大小','Total Threads Indexed'=>'索引的線程總數','Total Topics:'=>'總題目：','Total Views'=>'總瀏覽次數','Total WordPress Content'=>'總 WordPress 內容','Toxic Detected'=>'檢測到毒性','Toxicity Detection'=>'毒性檢測','Track AI feature usage and credit consumption'=>'追蹤 AI 功能使用情況和信用消費','Track Forum and Topic Current Viewers'=>'跟蹤論壇和主題當前觀眾','Track how community mood has changed over time with visualization of sentiment shifts, key events, and mood forecasting.'=>'透過可視化的情緒轉變、關鍵事件和情緒預測，追蹤社區情緒隨時間的變化。','Track posting velocity by IP address in addition to user account.'=>'除了使用者帳號之外，還可透過 IP 位址追蹤發佈速度。','Traditional search fails when users don\'t know exact keywords. Stop losing members to "no results found". AI-powered semantic search understands what users mean, not just what they type. Find relevant discussions even with different wording, typos, or synonyms—delivering answers that actually help.'=>'當使用者不知道精確的關鍵字時，傳統的搜尋就會失敗。不要再因為「找不到結果」而流失會員。人工智能驅動的語意搜尋能夠理解使用者的意思，而不只是他們輸入的字詞。即使有不同的措辭、錯誤或同義詞，也能找到相關的討論，提供真正有幫助的答案。','Transform document attachments into searchable knowledge. AI automatically extracts text from PDF, Word (DOCX), PowerPoint (PPTX), RTF, and plain text files attached to forum posts. Extracted content is chunked, embedded, and indexed alongside regular post text, making document contents fully searchable through AI semantic search and accessible to the AI chatbot. Ideal for forums with manuals, guides, reports, and technical documentation shared as attachments.'=>'將文件附件轉換為可搜尋的知識。AI 自動從論壇文章所附的 PDF、Word (DOCX)、PowerPoint (PPTX)、RTF 及純文字檔中抽取文字。擷取的內容會被分塊、內嵌，並與一般的文章文字一起編入索引，讓文件內容可透過 AI 語意搜尋完全搜尋，並可供 AI 聊天機器人存取。適用於以附件形式分享手冊、指南、報告和技術文件的論壇。','Translate'=>'翻譯','Translate this post'=>'翻譯此文章','Translating...'=>'翻譯...','Translation'=>'翻譯','Translation AI Quality'=>'翻譯 AI 品質','Trend:'=>'趨勢：','Trending Topics'=>'熱門話題','Trial Expired'=>'試用已過期','Trial expires: %s'=>'試用到期：%s','Triggered By'=>'觸發者','Troubleshooting - Fixing common issues'=>'疑難排解 - 修復常見問題','Troubleshooting Guide - Diagnostic approach'=>'故障排除指南 - 診斷方法','Tue'=>'星期二','Turkish'=>'土耳其語','Turn WordPress to this forum board'=>'將此論壇版面轉換為 WordPress','Turn WordPress to wpForo'=>'轉換WordPress到wpForo','Tutorial - Step-by-step guide'=>'教學 - 步驟說明','Tweet'=>'X.com','Tweet this post'=>'X.com這篇文章','Type'=>'類型','Type to search and select tags (comma-separated). Cannot be combined with User IDs filter.'=>'輸入要搜尋和選擇的標籤 (以逗號分隔)。無法與使用者 ID 過濾器結合。','Type to search users...'=>'輸入搜尋使用者...','Type your message...'=>'輸入您的訊息...','Type:'=>'類型：','Ukrainian'=>'烏克蘭','Ultimate Member'=>'終極會員','Ultimate Member Notification Integration'=>'終極會員通知整合','Ultimate Member Profile for the whole website including forum.'=>'整個網站包括論壇的終極會員檔案。','Ultimate Member Profile Forum Tab Integration'=>'終極會員資料論壇標籤整合','Ultimate Members Integration'=>'終極會員整合','Unable to connect to AI service.'=>'無法連線至 AI 服務。','Unanswered'=>'未回覆','Unapprove'=>'不批准','unapprove'=>'不批准','Unapproved'=>'未過審','unapproved'=>'未獲批准','Unapproved + Banned'=>'未核准 + 禁止','Unapproved Posts'=>'未經批准的帖子','unapproved topics - these will be indexed once approved by moderators'=>'未經批准的主題 - 這些主題經版主批准後會被編入索引','Unban'=>'解禁','Unban User'=>'不再屏蔽會員','Unban&nbsp;User'=>'解除封鎖&nbsp;使用者','Unbookmark'=>'取消書籤','Uncertain'=>'不確定','Under Construction'=>'施工中','Unfollow'=>'取消關注','Unified Moderation'=>'統一管理','Uninstall'=>'卸載','Unknown'=>'未知','Unknown upload error'=>'未知的上傳錯誤','unlike'=>'踩','Unlock the power of visual content in your forum. AI automatically analyzes images embedded in posts—screenshots, diagrams, infographics, product photos—and generates rich semantic embeddings. Visual information is indexed alongside text, enabling AI search and chat to understand and retrieve content based on what images show, not just surrounding text. Perfect for technical forums, support communities, and visual-heavy discussions.'=>'在您的論壇中釋放視覺化內容的力量。AI 會自動分析嵌入在文章中的圖片 - 螢幕截圖、圖表、資訊圖表、產品照片 - 並產生豐富的語意嵌入。視覺資訊會與文字一起編入索引，讓 AI 搜尋與聊天能夠根據圖片顯示的內容來理解與擷取內容，而不只是周遭的文字。非常適合技術論壇、支援社群和視覺密集的討論。','Unmute Mentioning Emails'=>'取消靜音提及電子郵件','Unread Posts'=>'未讀帖子','Unsolved'=>'未解決','Unsolved Topics'=>'未解決的主題','unsticky'=>'不置頂','Unsubscribe'=>'取消訂閱','Untitled'=>'無題','Up to 10,000 not-yet-indexed topics are queued per click (newest first). Private and unapproved topics are always skipped. Click again after processing completes to continue with the remaining topics.'=>'每次點擊最多可列舉 10,000 個尚未索引的主題 (最新的先列)。隱私和未核准的主題會被跳過。處理完成後再次按一下，繼續處理剩餘的主題。','Up Votes'=>'向上投票','Update'=>'更新','update'=>'更新','Update Forums Statistic'=>'更新論壇統計','Update Options'=>'更新選項','Update post dates (current date) to allow append posts to the end of the target topic.'=>'更新發布日期（當前日期）以允許將帖子附加到目標主題的末尾。
','Update post titles with target topic title.'=>'使用目標主題標題更新帖子標題。','Update Subscriptions'=>'更新訂閱','Update Topics Statistic'=>'更新主題統計信息','Update Users Statistic'=>'更新用戶統計','Updated Successfully!'=>'更新成功！','Upgrade'=>'升級','Upgrade Now / View Plans'=>'立即升級 / 檢視計劃','Upgrade Required'=>'需要升級','Upgrade to Business'=>'升級至商務','Upgrade to Professional'=>'升級至專業級','Upgrade to Professional Plan to Unlock'=>'升級至專業計劃以解鎖','Upgrade Your Plan'=>'升級您的計劃','Upload an avatar'=>'上傳一個頭像','Upload and replace %s file in %s directory,'=>'上傳並替換％s目錄中的%s文件，','Upload image'=>'上傳圖片','Uploading...'=>'上傳...','URL Address Identifier'=>'URL地址標識符','URL Structure'=>'URL 結構','URL to contact forum administrator'=>'聯絡論壇管理員的 URL','Usage Statistics'=>'使用統計','Use as Category'=>'用作分類','Use comments to ask for more information or suggest improvements. Avoid answering questions in comments.'=>'使用評論要求更多的信息或建議改進。避免在評論中回答問題。','Use custom-trained AI models tailored to your specific community needs.'=>'使用針對您特定社區需求量身打造的客製化訓練 AI 模型。','use default link color'=>'使用默認鏈接顏色','Use Forum Context for Analysis'=>'使用論壇內容進行分析','Use greater than 5 - below Posts, 10 - below Media, 15 - below Links, 20 - below Pages, 25 - below comments, 60 - below first separator, 65 - below Plugins, 70 - below Users, 75 - below Tools, 80 - below Settings, 100 - below second separator'=>'使用大於5 -下面的文章，10 -下面的媒體，15 -下面的鏈接，20 -下面的頁面，25 -下面的評論，60 -下面的第一個分隔符，65 -下面的插件，70 -下面的用戶，75 -下面的工具，80 -下面的設置，100 -下面的二級菜單','Use other knowledge sources'=>'使用其他知識來源','Use this image'=>'使用此圖片','Use this option only if you have set other pages for authorization. wpForo doesn\'t change its own URLs, these options are only for other plugin compatibility. For example, if you use BuddyPress or Ultimate Member plugin you can set your profile plugin url'=>'wpForo 不會改變自己的網址，這些選項只是為了與其他外掛程式相容。例如，如果您使用 BuddyPress 或 Ultimate Member 外掛程式，您可以設定您的個人檔案外掛程式網址','User'=>'用戶','User activate action error'=>'使用者啟動動作錯誤','User Activity Distribution'=>'使用者活動分佈','User ban action error'=>'用戶禁止操作錯誤','User Cookies'=>'用戶Cookie','User custom field update failed'=>'用戶自定義字段更新失敗','User Data'=>'用戶數據','User data update failed'=>'用戶數據更新失敗','User deactivate action error'=>'使用者停用動作錯誤','User delete error'=>'用戶刪除錯誤','User Delete Method'=>'使用者刪除方法','User Engagement'=>'使用者參與','User following notification email message'=>'使用者跟蹤通知電子郵件訊息','User following notification email subject'=>'使用者遵循通知電子郵件主題','User Group'=>'用戶組','User group add error'=>'用戶組添加錯誤','User group edit error'=>'用戶組編輯錯誤','User group successfully added'=>'用戶組添加成功','User group successfully edited'=>'用戶組編輯成功','User Groups'=>'用戶組','User Groups Secondary'=>'用戶組輔助','User ID'=>'用戶ID','user IDs'=>'使用者 ID','User is New (under hard spam control) during first [X] posts'=>'使用者在發表 [X] 篇文章時為新使用者 (受垃圾郵件硬體控制)','User leaves a reply to wpForo topic'=>'用戶留下對wpForo主題的回覆','User Limit/Day'=>'使用者上限/天','User Mention message body'=>'用戶提及郵件正文','User mention message subject'=>'用戶提及消息主題','User Message'=>'使用者訊息','User Meta Data'=>'用戶元數據','User profile fields not found'=>'未找到用戶個人資料字段','User profile update failed'=>'用戶個人資料更新失敗','User registration is disabled'=>'已禁止用戶註冊','User registration is disabled.'=>'用戶註冊已禁用。','User replied to wpForo post'=>'用戶回復了wpForo帖子','User Reputation'=>'使用者信譽','User Role'=>'用戶角色','User Roles'=>'用戶角色','User Self-Deleted Their Account'=>'使用者自行刪除帳戶','User successfully banned from wpforo'=>'用戶已成功取締從wpforo','User successfully deleted from wpforo'=>'用戶已從 wpforo 被刪除','User successfully unbanned from wpforo'=>'用戶已成功從wpforo取消禁用','User Title'=>'用戶頭銜','User unban action error'=>'用戶黑名單中刪除操作錯誤','Usergroup'=>'用戶組','usergroup'=>'用戶組','Usergroup Color'=>'用戶組顏色','Usergroup has been successfully deleted.'=>'已成功刪除用戶組。','Usergroup has been successfully deleted. All users of this usergroup have been moved to the usergroup you\'ve chosen'=>'已成功刪除用戶組。該用戶組的所有用戶都被移動到你選定的用戶組','Usergroup Name'=>'用戶組名稱','Usergroups'=>'用戶組','Usergroups Not Scanned by AI Antispam'=>'AI 反垃圾郵件未掃描的使用者群組','Usergroups with the "Dashboard - Moderate Topics & Posts" permission enabled will skip AI spam detection. Edit usergroup permissions to enable or disable this for each group. The "Front - Can pass moderation" permission is only bypass the default "unapproved" status and the post is being scanned by spam filters.'=>'啟用「儀表板 - 修改主題與文章」權限的使用者群組將跳過 AI 垃圾郵件偵測。編輯使用者群組權限可針對每個群組啟用或停用此功能。前台 - 可通過審查」權限只會跳過預設的「未批核」狀態，且文章正被垃圾郵件篩選程式掃描。','Usergroups with the "Front - Can pass moderation" permission enabled will skip AI spam detection. Edit usergroup permissions to enable or disable this for each group.'=>'啟用「Front - Can pass moderation」權限的使用者群組將跳過 AI 垃圾郵件偵測。編輯使用者群組權限可針對每個群組啟用或停用此功能。','Userid is wrong'=>'用戶ID錯誤','Username'=>'用戶名','Username exists. Please insert another.'=>'用戶名已存在, 請重新輸入。','Username is missed.'=>'此用戶名已存在','Username length must be between %d characters and %d characters.'=>'用戶名長度必須介於%d 個字符和%d 個字符之間。','Username length must be between 3 characters and 15 characters.'=>'用戶名長度必須介於3個字符和15個字符之間。','Username length must be between 3 characters and 30 characters.'=>'用戶名長度必須在3個字符和15個字符之間。','Username: [user_login]

