','Users'=>'用戶','Users get the Default Usergroup on registration'=>'用戶在註冊時獲得默認用戶組','Users will be join this usergroup'=>'用戶將加入這個用戶組','Users with this many or more posts will be skipped from AI spam detection. Set to 0 to disable this rule.'=>'有這麼多或更多文章的使用者會從 AI 垃圾郵件偵測中跳過。設定為 0 則停用此規則。','Using Forum as Support Tickets Board. Turns any forum into a private support ticket system.'=>'使用論壇作為支援票單討論區。將任何討論區變成私人支援票單系統。','Using this option you can disable user avatars for the forum but you cannot show avatars if the WordPress native avatar option is disabled. So please make sure the \'Show Avatars\' option is enabled in WordPress Settings > Discussion admin page.'=>'使用此選項，您可以停用論壇的使用者頭像，但如果 WordPress 原生頭像選項已停用，則無法顯示頭像。因此，請確定在 WordPress 設定 > 討論管理頁面中已啟用「顯示頭像」選項。','v3 Score Threshold'=>'v3 分數臨界值','Vector storage is not available.'=>'無法使用向量儲存。','vectors'=>'向量','Vectors are stored in gVectors AI Services on AWS for optimal performance with large datasets.'=>'向量儲存在 AWS 上的 gVectors AI 服務中，以獲得大型資料集的最佳效能。','Version'=>'版本','Vietnamese'=>'越南語','View'=>'查看','view'=>'查看','View all Addons'=>'查看全部擴展','View all AI actions performed on your forum including searches, translations, content generation, and more.'=>'檢視論壇上執行的所有 AI 動作，包括搜尋、翻譯、內容生成等。','view all posts'=>'查看全部帖子','view all questions'=>'查看全部問題','View all tags (%d)'=>'查看所有標籤 (%d)','view all topics'=>'查看全部話題','View Details'=>'檢視詳細資訊','View entire post'=>'查看整個帖子','View entire topic'=>'查看整個主題','View Logs'=>'檢視日誌','View Plans'=>'檢視計劃','View Stats'=>'檢視統計資料','View the latest post'=>'查看最新的帖子','View Users'=>'查看用戶','View users list in this usergroup'=>'查看該用戶組的用戶列表','Views'=>'查看','Views Count'=>'查看統計','Views:'=>'意見：','Visit Forum'=>'訪問論壇','Visual Editor'=>'可視編輯器','VKontakte'=>'VKontakte','Volatile'=>'揮發性','voted down'=>'否決','voted up'=>'投贊成票','Votes'=>'投票','Votes & Answers'=>'投票與答案','Want to start fresh? Disconnect to remove the current connection and register again.'=>'想要重新開始？断开连接以移除当前连接，然后重新注册。','Warm - Caring and compassionate'=>'溫暖 - 關懷與同情','Warning: This will disconnect your forum from wpForo AI service.'=>'警告：這將會中斷您的討論區與 wpForo AI 服務的連接。','Warning: This will permanently delete ALL your data from gVectors AI servers.'=>'警告：這將會從 gVectors AI 伺服器上永久刪除您的所有資料。','Website'=>'網站','Website name'=>'網站名稱','Wed'=>'星期三','Weekly'=>'每週','Welcome back %s!'=>'歡迎回到 %s!','Welcome Message'=>'歡迎信息','Welcome to our Community!'=>'歡迎來到我們的社區！','Welcome to wpForo'=>'歡迎來到wpForo','Welcome!'=>'歡迎！','What kind of problems do you have?'=>'你有什麼問題？','What part of design you don\'t like or want to change?'=>'您不喜歡或想要改變的設計部分是什麼？','What should be done with wpForo content owned by these users?'=>'應如何處理這些用戶擁有的wpForo內容？','What should be done with wpForo content owned by this user?'=>'應如何處理這些用戶擁有的wpForo內容？','What to do when a user exceeds flood limits.'=>'當使用者超過洪水限制時該如何處理。','What type of features you want to be in the plugin?'=>'您希望在插件中使用哪些類型的功能？','What\'s New'=>'最新消息','What\'s New in wpForo 3.0 - AI Edition'=>'wpForo 3.0 - AI 版的新功能','What\'s New Page'=>'最新消息頁面','When a member replies to one of my forum topics'=>'當會員回覆我的一個論壇主題時','When a member replies to one of my post in forum topics'=>'當會員回覆我在論壇主題中的一篇帖子時','When a post is reported set it under moderation.'=>'當一篇文章被報告時，請將它設為審查。','When AI features are enabled by the forum administrator, this site sends forum content (topics, posts, and metadata) to the gVectors AI API (api.gvectors.com) for processing. This processing includes semantic search, AI translation, summarization, content moderation, AI chat, and topic suggestions.'=>'當論壇管理員啟用 AI 功能時，本站會將論壇內容 (主題、文章和元資料) 傳送至 gVectors AI API (api.gvectors.com) 進行處理。此處理包括語意搜尋、AI 翻譯、摘要、內容管理、AI 聊天和主題建議。','When enabled, AI generates a summary and recommendations for search results. This feature is automatically disabled when search returns fewer than 3 results. Disabling saves credits.'=>'啟用時，AI 會產生搜尋結果的摘要和建議。當搜尋結果少於 3 個時，此功能會自動停用。停用可節省點數。','When enabled, AI will analyze new content for spam patterns including promotional content, link spam, and automated bot submissions.'=>'啟用後，AI 會分析新內容的垃圾郵件模式，包括促銷內容、垃圾連結和自動化的殭屍提交。','When enabled, AI will check content against forum rules and policies, detecting off-topic posts, prohibited content types, and policy violations.'=>'啟用時，AI 會根據論壇規則和政策檢查內容，偵測離題的文章、禁止的內容類型和違反政策的行為。','When enabled, AI will detect toxic content including hate speech, harassment, threats, profanity, and other harmful content that violates community guidelines.'=>'啟用後，AI 將偵測有毒內容，包括仇恨言論、騷擾、威脅、褻瀆和其他違反社群準則的有害內容。','When enabled, AI will suggest similar topics, related topics, and quick answers when users create new topics. This helps prevent duplicate topics and provides immediate assistance.'=>'啟用後，當使用者建立新主題時，AI 會建議類似主題、相關主題和快速解答。這有助於避免重複主題，並提供即時協助。','When enabled, AI will use indexed forum content as context to better understand what is normal content vs spam for your specific forum.'=>'啟用時，AI 會使用索引的論壇內容作為上下文，以更好地瞭解特定論壇的正常內容與垃圾內容。','When enabled, all topics in this forum will be created as private by default. Users cannot make topics public.'=>'啟用後，本論壇的所有主題預設都會建立為隱私。使用者無法公開主題。','When enabled, bot-generated replies will be set as unapproved and require manual approval before being visible.'=>'啟用後，殭屍產生的回覆將設定為未核准，需要手動核准才會顯示。','When enabled, task runs automatically when a new post is approved (instead of scheduled cron)'=>'啟用時，工作會在新文章被核准時自動執行 (而非排程的 cron)。','When enabled, task runs automatically when a new topic is approved (instead of scheduled cron)'=>'啟用時，任務會在新主題通過時自動執行 (而非排程的 cron)。','When enabled, the AI Assistant toggle button has a highlighted background color to attract attention. On hover it changes to the primary theme color.'=>'啟用時，AI Assistant 切換按鈕的背景顏色會突出顯示，以吸引注意。在懸停時會變為主要的主題顏色。','When enabled, the AI Assistant widget is displayed open by default on the forum home page. The toggle bar is hidden on the home page when open. On other pages the widget remains closed with the toggle.'=>'啟用時，AI Assistant Widget 預設會開啟顯示在論壇首頁。開啟時，切換列會隱藏在首頁上。在其他頁面上，Widget 會與切換條一起保持關閉狀態。','When enabled, the chatbot will consider the content of the current page (topic, forum) when answering questions.'=>'啟用後，聊天機器人回答問題時會考慮目前頁面（主題、論壇）的內容。','When enabled, the chatbot will search indexed forum content to provide accurate answers based on your forum\'s knowledge base.'=>'啟用後，聊天機器人會搜尋已編入索引的論壇內容，根據您論壇的知識庫提供準確的答案。','When you login first time using Facebook Login button, we collect your account %s information shared by Facebook, based on your privacy settings. We also get your email address to automatically create a forum account for you. Once your account is created, you\'ll be logged-in to this account and you\'ll receive a confirmation email.'=>'當您第一次使用Facebook登錄按鈕登錄時，我們會根據您的隱私設置收集Facebook共享的帳戶％s信息。我們還會收到您的電子郵件地址，以便自動為您創建論壇帳戶。創建帳戶後，您將登錄此帳戶，您將收到確認電子郵件。','Wherever you see white background and white font color'=>'只要您看到白色背景和白色字體顏色','Whether to update .htaccess (hard flush) or just update rewrite_rules option (soft flush). The hard option creates "rewrite_rules_bk_{sec}" record in "wp_options" table and .htaccess-bk-{sec} backup file in the root directory.'=>'是否更新 .htaccess (硬刷新) 或只更新 rewrite_rules 選項 (軟刷新)。硬選項會在 "wp_options 「表中建立 」rewrite_rules_bk_{sec}"記錄，並在根目錄中建立 .htaccess-bk-{sec} 備份檔案。','With the email address, please check the "I agree to receive email" checkbox to proceed.'=>'使用電子郵件地址，請選中“我同意接收電子郵件”複選框以繼續。','WooCommerce indexing'=>'WooCommerce 索引','WooCommerce Products Indexing'=>'WooCommerce 產品索引','Wordpress avatar system'=>'Wordpress 頭像系統','WordPress Blog Name'=>'WordPress 網誌名稱','WordPress Content Indexing'=>'WordPress 內容索引','WordPress Content indexing'=>'WordPress 內容索引','WordPress Content Indexing is available on Business and Enterprise plans. Upgrade to index WordPress posts, pages, and custom post types for AI-powered search.'=>'WordPress 內容索引適用於 Business 和 Enterprise 計劃。升級後可為 WordPress 帖子、頁面和自訂帖子類型建立索引，以進行人工智能搜索。','WordPress Email sending function wp_mail() doesn\'t work!'=>'WordPress電子郵件發送功能wp_mail（）不起作用！','WordPress Forum plugin. wpForo is the only AI powered forum solution for your community. Modern design and 5 forum layouts.'=>'WordPress 論壇外掛程式。wpForo 是唯一由 AI 驅動的論壇解決方案，適用於您的社群。現代化的設計和 5 種版面佈局。','WordPress Indexing'=>'WordPress 索引','WordPress Login Form'=>'WordPress登錄表單','WordPress plugin'=>'WordPress 外掛程式','WordPress Registration Form'=>'WordPress註冊表','WordPress Reset Password Form'=>'WordPress重置密碼表單','Working'=>'工作','wpForo'=>'wpForo','wpForo Addons'=>'wpForo 擴展插件','wpForo adds nofollow to all links with external URLs. If you want to keep some domains as internal please insert domains one per line in the textarea bellow.'=>'wpForo將nofollow添加到具有外部URL的所有鏈接。如果您想將某些域保留為內部域，請在textarea下面的每行插入一個域。','wpForo AI Features'=>'wpForo AI 功能','wpForo Antispam'=>'wpForo 反垃圾郵件','wpForo comes with built-in powerful forum SEO features. wpForo doesn\'t need any SEO plugin, however you should use SEO plugins for other parts of your website (posts, pages, products, etc...). wpForo disables SEO plugins on forum pages and generates all necessary SEO meta tags.'=>'wpForo 內建強大的版面 SEO 功能。wpForo 不需要任何 SEO 外掛程式，但是您應該使用 SEO 外掛程式在您網站的其他部分 (文章、頁面、產品...等...)。','wpForo Community'=>'wpForo 社群','wpForo Dashboard'=>'wpForo 儀錶盤','wpForo Database Update Problem - Action Required!'=>'wpForo數據庫更新問題 - 需要採取措施！','wpForo Documentation'=>'wpForo 文件','wpForo forum has a powerful user profile system which can be managed in this setting page. Here you can hide/show forum header and footer on profile pages, manage profile components like avatars, member titles, nickname, URL structure, signature etc... In case you use BuddyPress or Ultimate Members plugins, you can switch forum profile page to the plugin profile page.'=>'wpForo 論壇擁有強大的會員個人資料系統，您可以在此設定頁面管理會員個人資料。您可以在設定頁面中隱藏/顯示版面頁頭和頁尾，管理個人資料元件，例如頭像、會員標題、暱稱、網址結構、簽名等等。如果您使用 BuddyPress 或 Ultimate Members 外掛程式，您可以將討論區的個人資料頁面切換到外掛程式的個人資料頁面。','wpForo Forum Installation | '=>'wpForo Forum安裝 |','wpForo has almost all kind of way to keep forum users updated about the latest posted content. Users can subscribe to forums and topics, they can be mentioned in posts, they can follow to other users. On all these cases, users get email and in-forum notification. And all these features can be managed in this admin section.'=>'wpForo 擁有幾乎所有的方式讓論壇用戶了解最新張貼的內容。用戶可以訂閱討論區和主題，他們可以在文章中被提及，他們可以跟隨其他用戶。在所有這些情況下，用戶都會收到電子郵件和論壇通知。所有這些功能都可以在此管理區中進行管理。','wpForo has built-in member reputation system based on points user get when he/she creates new topic, posts, when gets likes or dislikes. This system grants Rating Titles and Rating Badges. All component of this system (number of posts, titles, badges) can be customized and changed in this admin section.'=>'wpForo 內建了會員聲譽系統，當使用者建立新主題、發表文章、獲得喜歡或不喜歡時，都會獲得分數。這個系統賦予評級標題和評級徽章。此系統的所有元件 (文章數量、頭銜、徽章) 都可以在此管理區段中自訂與變更。','wpForo has not found any protection solution against spam user registration on the forum registration form. Please %1$s and enable the %2$s antibot protection in %3$s or install other alternative %4$s to avoid registration of spam users.'=>'wpForo 未找到任何防止垃圾使用者註冊論壇註冊表單的解決方案。請 %1$s 並在 %3$s 啟用 %2$s 反垃圾程式保護或安裝其他替代 %4$s 以避免垃圾使用者註冊。','wpForo has own cache system, enable this to reduce sql requests and make your forum run faster.'=>'wpForo 有自己的快取系統，啟用它可以減少 sql 請求，使您的論壇運行更快。','wpForo is a forum plugin which is loaded in one WordPress page, so the whole forum with its categories, forums, topics, members and profile pages are loaded dynamically in one WordPress page. Almost all components you can see in the page content area (forum area) can be displayed or hidden in wpForo settings, especially here, in the Display Components admin page.'=>'wpForo 是一個在 WordPress 頁面中載入的論壇外掛程式，因此整個論壇的分類、版面、主題、會員及個人資料頁面都是動態載入在一個 WordPress 頁面中。幾乎所有您可以在頁面內容區域（論壇區域）看到的元件，都可以在 wpForo 設定中顯示或隱藏，尤其是這裡的顯示元件管理頁面。','wpForo is one of the very rare plugins which has its own user registration and login pages. Both features are based on WordPress functions. Here you can control user registration, account approval and deleting settings. Also, you can manage redirections after user login, register and password resting actions.'=>'wpForo 是極少數擁有自己的使用者註冊與登入頁面的外掛程式之一。這兩個功能都是以 WordPress 功能為基礎。您可以在此控制使用者註冊、帳號核准與刪除設定。此外，您也可以管理使用者登入、註冊及恢復密碼動作後的重定向。','wpForo is well integrated with BuddyPress and with all plugins and themes based on BuddyPress. The integration includes changing forum profile page URL to BuddyPress profile page URL, Activity Integration and Forum Tabs on BuddyPress profile page.'=>'wpForo 與 BuddyPress 以及所有以 BuddyPress 為基礎的外掛和主題整合得很好。整合包括將論壇個人資料頁的 URL 更改成 BuddyPress 個人資料頁的 URL、活動整合以及 BuddyPress 個人資料頁上的論壇標籤。','wpForo is well integrated with Ultimate Members plugin. The integration includes changing forum profile page URL to Ultimate Members profile page URL, forum tabs in Ultimate Members profile page. Also, wpForo is integrated with Ultimate Members\' Real-time Notifications addon.'=>'wpForo 與 Ultimate Members 插件整合得很好。整合包括將論壇個人資料頁的 URL 改為 Ultimate Members 個人資料頁的 URL，以及在 Ultimate Members 個人資料頁中加入論壇標籤。此外，wpForo 也與 Ultimate Members 的即時通知插件整合。','wpForo logging system allows tracking and providing live information about forum viewers. It detects read/unread status of forums and posts for guests and logged-in users individually. Here you can manage all functions and features of the forum logging system.'=>'wpForo 日誌系統允許追蹤並提供論壇瀏覽者的即時資訊。它可以偵測論壇的已讀/未讀狀態，以及訪客和登入用戶的個別文章。您可以在此管理論壇記錄系統的所有功能與特性。','wpForo Login Form'=>'wpForo登錄表','wpForo Menu'=>'wpForo菜單','wpForo Navigation'=>'wpForo 導航','wpForo phrases are missing!'=>'wpForo短語不見了！','wpForo Polls addon is disabled!'=>'wpForo 投票附加元件已停用！','wpForo Profile for the whole website including forum, comment authors, post authors and etc...'=>'wpForo Profile 適用於整個網站，包括論壇、評論作者、文章作者等...','wpForo Profile only for the forum, WordPress Profile for others, including comment authors, post authors and etc...'=>'wpForo 個人資料僅用於論壇，WordPress 個人資料則用於其他人，包括評論作者、文章作者等...','wpForo Registration Form'=>'wpForo註冊表','wpForo Reset Password Form'=>'wpForo重設密碼表格','wpForo SEO'=>'wpForo SEO','wpForo Sidebar'=>'wpForo側邊欄','wpForo Sidebar Location'=>'wpForo 側邊欄位置','wpForo Spam Co